。", "url": "https://x.com/btc2ai/status/2083612981796253893"}, {"id": "2083116257872859401", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "EinsteinYipie", "text": "不过从一些蛛丝马迹来看 uniswap 似乎已经在准备做新产品，我猜可能是v4相关的东西。\\n\\n昨晚uni创始人 @haydenzadams 用一个������表情包回复了一条问 “https://t.co/pqDukQ56QV是什么的”推文，而 https://t.co/pqDukQ56QV 官网正是一只青蛙跳入水池的视频。\\n\\n然后链上出现一个meme $FRONG (有人发现dev地址是 uni 的产品设计师 @zacklabadie），所以让人浮想联翩。\\n\\n不过需要注意的是 $FRONG 关联的dex链接是诈骗，自称是创始人的都是骗子。\\n\\n目前 @zacklabadie 暂未发声。\\n\\nhttps://t.co/pqDukQ56QV 官网目前也没啥实质内容。", "url": "https://x.com/EinsteinYipie/status/2083116257872859401"}, {"id": "2083966437530718654", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "raidmach1ne", "text": "$FRONG\\n\\nX CT folks are silent\\nTG folks are silent\\nNo X community, no X Frong page.\\nNOTHING.\\n\\nAnd chart is ranging between 1.8-3m mc with 1.5-2m daily volume during last few days without ANY talks on X lol.\\n\\nIf @haydenzadams, @saintniko or @zacklabadie is going to interact with frong, price will explode.\\n\\n0x6245e67affA44a23077f0Ea7f981a8DC743a0c47", "url": "https://x.com/raidmach1ne/status/2083966437530718654"}, {"id": "2083603987333517776", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "btc2ai", "text": "$FRONG 新青蛙解读 #Robinhood 有背书的疑是新发射台meme龙头\\n\\n0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47\\n\\n1）RH Uniswap新发射台https://t.co/brKf8fDCaY 高度关联：\\n\\n疑是由Uniswap产品设计师Zack Labadie @zacklabadie\\r部署。部署走的是Uniswap在Robinhood Chain上的新Launchpad https://t.co/brKf8fDCaY，使用了特殊的dev branch launch合约，fee NFT指向labadie.eth。\\n\\n������ 重点来了：\\n青蛙图片在代币上线前就已出现在https://t.co/brKf8fDCaY的CDN上，被认为是该产品的官方mascot。 \\n\\n2）Hayden Adams即Uniswap创始人互动：有人问https://t.co/brKf8fDCaY是什么时，Hayden直接回了表情，算是暗示\\n\\n另外 $FRONG 被视为Uniswap在RH Chain上的吉祥物和青蛙代表。可以理解为 RH上的Pepe", "url": "https://x.com/btc2ai/status/2083603987333517776"}, {"id": "2083161703047434459", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": " that's a teaser referencing the ticker before the hype even peaked.\\nHayden Adams replied to the frog emoji thread. Said nothing outright. Confirmed nothing. But he didn't have to reply at all.\\n\\nAdd it up and this stops looking like a random meme launch.\\n\\nNo official statement from Uniswap yet.\\n\\nhttps://t.co/ORMaCGu2qj\"", "text": "$FRONG — what we know so far:\\n\\nDeployed through Uniswap's own official LiquidityLauncher contract. Not a random deploy — the contract itself is Uniswap's.\\nTx metadata carries a signed confirmation from @zacklabadie — an actual Uniswap product designer.\\nhttps://t.co/xDByqj7Bfm already teases \\Coming soon from Uniswap\\\" — with a background video literally named frong.mp4. That's not a coincidence riding a pump", "url": "https://x.com/ that's a teaser referencing the ticker before the hype even peaked.\\nHayden Adams replied to the frog emoji thread. Said nothing outright. Confirmed nothing. But he didn't have to reply at all.\\n\\nAdd it up and this stops looking like a random meme launch.\\n\\nNo official statement from Uniswap yet.\\n\\nhttps://t.co/ORMaCGu2qj\"/status/2083161703047434459"}, {"id": "2083319046330818995", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "biiiiymeister", "text": "FRONG’s fees have not been collected recently.\\n\\nthe deploy of $FRONG never collected fees , never harvested \\n\\nThere are many other tokens launched on it's vault all harvested and sent here\\n\\nhttps://t.co/L0Wn7GsFsB\\n\\nso @zacklabadie or uniswap team , they won't like that I front-run this , I know https://t.co/49HO9W0aQ8 is coming.\\n\\nSorry not sorry.\\n\\nUncollected FRONG fees  \\n   \\n→ remain inside position 409801     \\n→ FRONG not visible at 0x666  After collectFees([409801])     \\n\\n→ FRONG moves to 0x666     \\n→ FRONG becomes visible  After compounding     \\n→ FRONG is added back to LP     \\n→ balance may return to zero     \\n→ FRONG disappears again\\n\\nSorry again for front-run.", "url": "https://x.com/biiiiymeister/status/2083319046330818995"}, {"id": "2083100354800169310", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "RHDaily__", "text": "Most traded Robinhood projects\\n\\nWhich one’s going parabolic?������\\n\\n$FRONG\\n$HOODRAT\\n$CASHCAT\\n$PONS\\n$STONKBROKER\\n$IF\\n$BRODIE\\n$TENDIES\\n$AI\\n$UNICASH https://t.co/FVzDbUV8Hb", "url": "https://x.com/RHDaily__/status/2083100354800169310"}, {"id": "2084483576071168006", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "birdeye_so", "text": "$FRONG is rumored to be launched by a Uniswap employee and deployed on https://t.co/E7IDINeb4o - Uniswap's launchpad on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nOfficial contract address: 0x6245e67affA44a23077f0Ea7f981a8DC743a0c47\\n\\nTrack $FRONG on Birdeye: https://t.co/hVjZKV9edy", "url": "https://x.com/birdeye_so/status/2084483576071168006"}, {"id": "2083355963231240619", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": " tracing back to his ENS and also including social links to his X account within the launch transaction. PvP ends.\\n\\n(4) Hayden", "text": "Summary on $FRONG\\n\\n(1) Zack, Uniswap Product Designer, verifiably uploads the \\frong.mp4\\\" video to the Amazon S3 bucket hosting assets for the landing page of the upcoming https://t.co/WlEcWl8njd Uniswap launchpad.\\n\\n(2) Trenchers see the frog has a name given by the title of the video file. Dozens of tickers are launched by randoms.\\n\\n(3) Zack verifiably launches $FRONG on the https://t.co/WlEcWl8njd launchpad himself", "url": "https://x.com/ tracing back to his ENS and also including social links to his X account within the launch transaction. PvP ends.\\n\\n(4) Hayden/status/2083355963231240619"}, {"id": "2083893156748128679", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Salpha_bot", "text": "$FRONG\\n\\nFRONG is a Robinhood Chain memecoin that became the de facto mascot for Uniswap's unreleased https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i launchpad. It was deployed via Uniswap's public LiquidityLauncher as deploy #464 on a permissionless factory that had been running for weeks, using an unreleased InstantLaunchStrategy deployed by Uniswap's deployment wallet one day earlier and replaced shortly after; team-linked wallets tested the system and Hayden Adams interacted with the factory. Community members attribute the launch to Uniswap product designer Zack LaBadie, citing a fee NFT for labadie.eth, wallet history, and uploaded FRONG media, while pools.trade-affiliated accounts 0xbaua and 0xBuffs say FRONG was not publicly created by the team, name kairun as the first test token, and also claim the team supports the community coin. The contract design is unusually clean (no creator allocation, locked liquidity, no LP rug mechanism, fees compounding), though the fee loop can encourage churn. https://t.co/Y8rXq5Ekjd is billed as 'Coming soon from Uniswap Pools'; FRONG appeared as 'Coming Soon' on the Uniswap site and was the only thing on the https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i website, with a frog image and #frong video names on the CDN before launch making it the apparent PEPE of Robinhood Chain (the logo is a lotus leaf, a frog habitat). STELLA launched 9 seconds earlier via the same launcher from a different wallet, and a POOLS token carries unauthenticated metadata claiming @saintniko with a fake X user ID; the launcher stores metadata without on-chain authentication, and a Telegram user counted three FRONG tickers.\\n\\n───\\n\\nT E A M\\n������������ ������������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������������ ������������������������������������������������������������. ������������������ ������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������������������������������ ������������������ ������������-������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������ @������������������������������������������������������������������ ������������������ ������������������������������.������������������������������'������ ������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������, ������������������������������������ @0������������������������������������ (������������������������������.������������������������������ ������������������������������������������) ������������������ @0������������������������������ (������������������������������������ ������������������������������.������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������������������������) ������������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������ ������������������������ ������������������ ������������������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������������������������, ������������������������������������ $������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������ ������������������������ ������������������������������������������������ ������������������������ ������������������������������.\\n\\n@0xBuffs | ������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������������������������; ������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������.������������������������������ ������������ IN · renamed 5×\\n↳ X bio describes him as a builder at bankrbot and founder of https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i. In project-authored tweets he asserted that FRONG is a community coin not created by the team, that kairun is the only test token, and that other tokens are scams; he later thanked Uniswap for supporting FRONG. Community claims also quote him declaring FRONG a scam.\\n\\n@0xbaua | ������������������������������������ ������������ ������������ ������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������.������������������������������ ������������ IN · renamed 2×\\n↳ Unknown background, but claims affiliation with https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i via tweets. On X he says FRONG is a scam and not created by https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i, names 0x7bad704d752d1ec84ed122cb4ff891d0b6551f8c as the only test token, and says https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i has not publicly created any memecoins. He also expresses excitement about https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i and notes many fakes are hitting high market caps.\\n\\n@zacklabadie | ������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������; ������������������������������������������������������ ������������������������������������������������ ������������ ������������������������������ ������������ US · renamed 2×\\n↳ Uniswap product designer. Community and on-chain evidence identify him as the likely FRONG deployer: a fee NFT points to labadie.eth, the deployer's Ethereum address is visible on his personal website https://t.co/tKk3SIP28Z, and a wallet 0xca65... is described as his. Multiple accounts assert he launched FRONG; the token used Uniswap's unreleased InstantLaunchStrategy.\\n\\nC A T A L Y S T S\\nThe catalyst picture is dominated by Uniswap-adjacent signals rather than product announcements: the https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i team thanks Uniswap, community members cite an employee posting and a Uni dev creating FRONG, and Hayden Adams' frog-emoji reply is read as an implicit endorsement. A secondary cluster is the launch-timing narrative — STELLA beat FRONG by 9 seconds, raising questions about who is internal — and the shared expectation that when https://t.co/xdjeW0Ci6i goes live, attention rotates back to FRONG. The section also includes early alerting, Robinhood trending, and a warning that the entire narrative preceded the token, with fake contracts circulating before the real deploy.\\n↳ via @RHDaily__ @arndxt_xo @Solrythh @BitStern @PweasenT1\\n\\nC O M M U N I T Y\\nCommunity sentiment splits between conviction that FRONG is the real face of Uniswap's launchpad and repeated disclaimers from pools.trade-affiliated accounts calling it a scam. The bull case is loud — a 'no brainer', 'frog szn', the kind of innovation crypto needs — but it coexists with a bitter debate over whether the STELLA-first launch proves insider involvement or simply someone using a permissionless factory. The recurring tension is the launch-order narrative: the thesis rests on a Uniswap insider launch, while skeptics argue the mechanism is permissionless and metadata is unauthenticated. Stella FUD and team-rug accusations add further friction.\\n↳ via @seacreaturesamn @SnekCalls @BitGod21 @jiggernextdoor @Osekbcn\\n\\nA L P H A\\nThe on-chain record shows a token with a clean contract design but a far messier market: the opening minute saw bots grab ~47% of supply, and the bulk of the headline volume is circular. Named whales from TENDIES, AI, and CASHCAT accumulated across market caps, while a separate trail ties the deployer to Zack LaBadie via https://t.co/tKk3SIP28Z and a 0xca65... wallet. The STELLA contract and the POOLS sender introduce competing timelines and a spoofed-looking saintniko metadata claim, and users caution that the deployer's 18 launches and the permissionless factory make provenance genuinely ambiguous.\\n↳ via @minse_096 @arndxt_xo @NockTerminal @whalewatchRH @Stupid_Gas", "url": "https://x.com/Salpha_bot/status/2083893156748128679"}, {"id": "2083047389540032783", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Opifor", "text": "One more detail makes this sequence even harder to dismiss as coincidence.\\n\\n    E195 did not only launch FRONG through the instant-pool route. During the same test window, it submitted a bid into the\\n    existing camry/TOYODA auction created through Uniswap’s canonical CCA factory:\\n\\n    https://t.co/nNM1GHHt2X\\n\\n    Exactly 1,110 seconds later, E195 launched CHWDR through the other route: the official Uniswap LBP/Continuous Clearing Auction\\n    stack:\\n\\n    https://t.co/1DbpDaUo4F\\n\\n    The sequence was:\\n\\n    FRONG instant pool → bid into TOYODA’s CCA → CHWDR CCA launch.\\n\\n    That looks like a deliberate end-to-end test of the two launch modes described by https://t.co/nItIRFUSB1: instant liquidity or\\n    crowd-priced auction.\\n\\n    Once this is combined with the frog asset uploaded under Zack’s Uniswap email, Zack’s verified wallet historically funding\\n    E195, and Zack’s wallet being selected as FRONG’s fee beneficiary, my personal confidence is now around 99% that FRONG was a\\n    team-linked meme test for Uniswap’s upcoming launchpad, very likely its first public frog-themed launch.\\n\\n    That 99% is an evidence-based confidence assessment, not cryptographic proof that Zack personally held E195’s private key. But\\n    the independent-copycat explanation is now extremely difficult to maintain.", "url": "https://x.com/Opifor/status/2083047389540032783"}, {"id": "2083081441772974451", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "ZXOAR_Launch", "text": "$FRONG on Robinhood Chain wasn't launched by an anonymous rando.\\n\\nThe deployer wallet (0xE195...cE58) was directly funded on Base starting Nov 2024 by a wallet verified on Zack Labadie's (Uniswap) Farcaster. Gas, NFTs, 205.79 $HIGHER. Months before launch.\\n\\nSame wallet then ran months of tests on Uniswap's own launch infra (https://t.co/T9exe0QMYN): instant pools, LBP/CCA auctions (CHWDR), and set the same Labadie-linked wallet as fee beneficiary.\\n\\nIt's all onchain. Not key-ownership proof, but this looks like an internal Uniswap/pools.trade test wallet, not a copycat.\\nThe proof wasn't in the launch tx. It was in the old Base history. ������\\n\\n$FRONG $HIGHER #Uniswap #RobinhoodChain #Base #Onchain", "url": "https://x.com/ZXOAR_Launch/status/2083081441772974451"}, {"id": "2083038294464467259", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Opifor", "text": "I was having a boring day onchain today, so I started poking around because of all the noise around $FRONG.\\n\\n    There is one part of the story that is real: the large frog video on https://t.co/nItIRFUSB1 is an actual site asset, and its archived S3\\n    metadata names zack.labadie@uniswap.org as the uploader. The exact object version was last modified on July 28 at 23:20 UTC.\\n    An independent URLScan capture shows https://t.co/nItIRFUSB1 publicly loading frong.mp4 by July 30 at 17:11 UTC:\\n\\n    https://t.co/c6yjsDc2lz\\n\\n    FRONG was launched at 20:16 UTC that same day. This means the frog video, its filename, and Zack's uploader identity were\\n    publicly discoverable for at least 3 hours and 5 minutes before the token appeared onchain.\\n\\n    That timing matters.\\n\\n    The wallet that actually signed the FRONG launch was not Zack's known labadie.eth wallet. It was:\\n\\n    0xE19537029b8013DC37c55d509b0a5038C7C5cE58\\n\\n    Zack's Farcaster-verified address, 0x1db6...2FD0, was supplied by E195 as the fee beneficiary. It received a Fee Beneficiary\\n    NFT, not launch funding:\\n\\n    https://t.co/hMu03StUus\\n\\n    This distinction is important because the beneficiary is simply a parameter chosen by the caller. The owner of that address\\n    does not have to sign or approve anything. Anyone could have entered Zack's public wallet as the beneficiary.\\n\\n    The claim that Zack's wallet funded the FRONG deployer is also not supported by the transaction history. E195 funded itself by\\n    bridging roughly 0.108 ETH from its own Ethereum address to the same address on Robinhood Chain about 93 seconds before\\n    launching FRONG:\\n\\n    https://t.co/t7z1yj1y8X\\n\\n    I also found no direct ETH, token, or indexed internal transfer from Zack's Farcaster-verified wallets to E195.\\n\\n    FRONG's metadata contains Zack's X handle, X user ID, and the E195 wallet address. That looks convincing at first, but the\\n    launcher does not verify those identity fields or cryptographically bind them to Zack. The same production LiquidityLauncher\\n    later accepted a test token containing a fake X handle, fake user ID, zero wallet address, and unverified signature-like bytes:\\n\\n    https://t.co/XY8UJMQf2R\\n\\n    So there is a technically valid alternative explanation:\\n\\n    A third party could have discovered the public frong.mp4 asset and its uploader metadata, looked up Zack's public X and\\n    Farcaster information, selected labadie.eth as the fee beneficiary, copied Zack's identity into the unverified token\\n    metadata, and launched FRONG in a way designed to look like an internal Uniswap test.\\n\\n    This does not prove that FRONG was spoofed. The video provenance and the FRONG/CHWDR transaction sequence still make an\\n    internal test plausible.\\n\\n    But if Zack or someone on the Uniswap side did launch it, they did not want to leave any publicly verifiable proof behind, or\\n    at least they chose a setup that leaves none. There is no signed message, wallet-control proof, or verifiable backend\\n    attestation connecting E195 to Zack or Uniswap.\\n\\n    That leaves us with two scenarios that currently look identical from the outside:\\n\\n    1. An internal test launched without public attribution.\\n    2. A carefully staged third-party launch built from public information.\\n\\n    The evidence proves that Zack's Uniswap email was attached to the frog asset. It proves that E195 launched FRONG and selected\\n    a Zack-linked address as the fee beneficiary. It does not prove that Zack controlled E195.\\n\\n    Until E195 signs an ownership statement, or a verifiable backend attestation ties that wallet to Zack or the team, “Zack\\n    launched FRONG” remains speculation, not an onchain fact.", "url": "https://x.com/Opifor/status/2083038294464467259"}, {"id": "2084147144689119717", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Kr1yo1", "text": "There seems to be some confusion around this new wave of rh uniswap coins\\n\\nOf course $FRONG is leading, but it’s not the first coin deployed\\n\\nMany see that it’s $TOYODA based on an image that was circulating, showing the below ca deployed at 16:11 \\n\\n(Not first deploy) 100k mc\\n0xE9D9518fB64D571f4670F8307D9C502Eb524dd40\\n\\nIn fact, there’s a coin that predates it by exactly 3 minutes- the og $TOYODA. It’s verifiable that’s it’s deployed via uniswaps new router pair because it utilizes the leaked auction mode— Showing the chart beginning at a previously generated price before trading from that mc just like $CHWDR, which was deployed by the $FRONG dev.\\n\\nI’m super excited to see what’s cooking and I have a feeling once the screener on https://t.co/YQqW3hnsFL is live there is going to be a violent repricing when $TOYODA shows up as the oldest pair\\n\\nOG $TOYODA & First UNI coin deployed w new router - 20k mc\\n0x1f693760133e6d6635ab31efca289040e547ee73", "url": "https://x.com/Kr1yo1/status/2084147144689119717"}, {"id": "2084347640959914047", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "0datafound", "text": "Holding $FRONG \\n\\n0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47\\n\\nI’ll dca if it dip lower https://t.co/yMUYCbqWqo", "url": "https://x.com/0datafound/status/2084347640959914047"}, {"id": "2084457078534570455", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "dckazi", "text": "Uniswap is about to do the funniest thing and i'm positioned for it. \\n\\n$frong https://t.co/z1hM8IshTt", "url": "https://x.com/dckazi/status/2084457078534570455"}, {"id": "2084455999075971481", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "0xSweep", "text": "$FRONG is breaking out and hit new ATHs @ $7M MC\\n\\nGet ready ������ https://t.co/5doQDqJwsp", "url": "https://x.com/0xSweep/status/2084455999075971481"}, {"id": "2084427751537205708", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "NockTerminal", "text": "$Frong = The clear Frog meta on Uniswap\\n\\n$Abe is the dog of Uniswap\\n\\n$Unifrog Beta play of FRONG", "url": "https://x.com/NockTerminal/status/2084427751537205708"}, {"id": "2084324681784643830", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "MeltedMindz", "text": "Ok so https://t.co/Kw8kd4xyFf and $FRONG\\n\\n@haydenzadams @saintniko \\n\\nGive the trenches a sign.", "url": "https://x.com/MeltedMindz/status/2084324681784643830"}, {"id": "2084374358710010178", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "blockArcanixX", "text": "@PeeTMM CATE has everyone's attention right now\\n\\n$cate $frong https://t.co/DtqKKywrrl", "url": "https://x.com/blockArcanixX/status/2084374358710010178"}, {"id": "2084454598614598046", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Imperiumeternal", "text": "$FRONG YOUR $FRONGS\\n\\nWHAT A FUCKING MASTERPIECE. https://t.co/4eFIDBUwnJ", "url": "https://x.com/Imperiumeternal/status/2084454598614598046"}, {"id": "2084466881902346418", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "ericgudboy", "text": "@rickytheirish this frong report is wild, the labadie.eth tie is the key detail imo watching closely before https://t.co/1L5SoOkPBq goes live", "url": "https://x.com/ericgudboy/status/2084466881902346418"}, {"id": "2084417164212142325", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "kenny_powerz_", "text": "One of the best looking charts on Robinhood Chain.. $FRONG has one of the highest potential upsides considering it’s been trading between $2-&gt;6M with zero confirmation. If &amp; when Uniswap confirms this as the first https://t.co/vdaZSlZc4x meme &amp; the potential mascot, easy 5-10x ������ https://t.co/O4BqPmVfvx", "url": "https://x.com/kenny_powerz_/status/2084417164212142325"}, {"id": "2084441632934408218", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": " \\n$frong launchpad is uniswap\\nbut irl frog jump with $lillypad \\n$uniswap is $frong $lillypad \\nthus $lillypad best beta to $frong\\n\\nipfs data to $lillypad found on rh data : https://t.co/urzxwiMPVx\\n\\nThe og (there's only one) : \\n0x263133af8fca97f9c161385769b0624df1b57d63\"", "text": "I see many people bidding $unifrong or the og $unifrog,\\nbut im here to bring next level thesis to life\\n\\nthe greatest frog thesis LILLYPAD\\n\\Frog sits on Lillypad\\\"\\n0x263133af8fca97f9c161385769b0624df1b57d63\\n\\n$lillypad (the #424th token from https://t.co/AvuBQ4EvPG)\\n\\nfrogs need launchpad to jump", "url": "https://x.com/ \\n$frong launchpad is uniswap\\nbut irl frog jump with $lillypad \\n$uniswap is $frong $lillypad \\nthus $lillypad best beta to $frong\\n\\nipfs data to $lillypad found on rh data : https://t.co/urzxwiMPVx\\n\\nThe og (there's only one) : \\n0x263133af8fca97f9c161385769b0624df1b57d63\"/status/2084441632934408218"}, {"id": "2084408518778499455", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Viraltbh", "text": "fuck them kids am i right???? $frong", "url": "https://x.com/Viraltbh/status/2084408518778499455"}, {"id": "2084468084174127144", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "lootstack0", "text": "$Frong sits on $Lillypad and $Lillypad sits on https://t.co/gv6YwqiqDP \\n\\n0x263133af8fca97f9c161385769b0624df1b57d63 https://t.co/zGggMmx06q", "url": "https://x.com/lootstack0/status/2084468084174127144"}, {"id": "2084454290509426791", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Daniel3034", "text": "@btc2ai $UNIFROG , $FRONG is view hour deploy after $UNIFROG", "url": "https://x.com/Daniel3034/status/2084454290509426791"}, {"id": "2084369012025344148", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "deluquant", "text": "aeon leading base volume at 633k as pool liquidity deepens while robinhood momentum shifts to frong with delu conviction at 0.74 and woof holding conviction at 0.72", "url": "https://x.com/deluquant/status/2084369012025344148"}, {"id": "2084464739963346973", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Ashmix__", "text": "$Unifrog 0x7eD4e0c78d1617bCec1497180a42770ec438f6Fc first coin on $Frong Launchpad \\n0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47", "url": "https://x.com/Ashmix__/status/2084464739963346973"}, {"id": "2084459992246308954", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "gvneth", "text": "@haydenzadams when is https://t.co/pD0yuWT8zg $frong coming?", "url": "https://x.com/gvneth/status/2084459992246308954"}, {"id": "2084448554291277864", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "Daniel3034", "text": "ONCHAIN NEVER LIE, $UNIFROG is more earlier than $FRONG , proof \\nhttps://t.co/aOmZAmUD9c https://t.co/EkTFn2lmQZ", "url": "https://x.com/Daniel3034/status/2084448554291277864"}, {"id": "2084412565946347966", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "usbxHL", "text": "The OG memes on pools trade are $FRONG and $UNICASH \\n\\nRemind me of this tweet when https://t.co/zyoeqvVds2 goes live https://t.co/21jxSGY4Cd", "url": "https://x.com/usbxHL/status/2084412565946347966"}, {"id": "2084427688320942508", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "StylishDegen", "text": "its for the community to decide which $UNIFROG is OG or which they are gonna run\\n\\n$Frong is still the number one in my kitty heart", "url": "https://x.com/StylishDegen/status/2084427688320942508"}, {"id": "2084438340456124914", "q": "$FRONG robinhood", "author": "TheVirtualFlame", "text": "He could still buy $FRONG before we go to 88M", "url": "https://x.com/TheVirtualFlame/status/2084438340456124914"}, {"id": "2083825470345552182", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "iromeansstar", "text": "@GainzRH @zacklabadie This is massive", "url": "https://x.com/iromeansstar/status/2083825470345552182"}, {"id": "2084175807346270554", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "rhodfun", "text": "Uniswap Auction Summer\\n\\nHello @Uniswap @zacklabadie \\n\\nhttps://t.co/tnsMKATicc first uniswap auction launchpad.\\n\\nhttps://t.co/zu8IfXebaY", "url": "https://x.com/rhodfun/status/2084175807346270554"}, {"id": "2084128526408802733", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "Tcalledpresence", "text": "Following $FRONG, $CHWRD is the second token launched by @zacklabadie on Uni Launch.", "url": "https://x.com/Tcalledpresence/status/2084128526408802733"}, {"id": "2084100537633427625", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "TheVirtualFlame", "text": "@beeboopx @Uniswap @zacklabadie Craziness in the robinhood catacombs. If you dive deep enough you find shit like this ^", "url": "https://x.com/TheVirtualFlame/status/2084100537633427625"}, {"id": "2084276492281040944", "q": "zacklabadie"