tps://x.com/guccigff/status/2083319999293280294"}, {"id": "2083325972519272549", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "dino_kun1n9", "text": "@biiiiymeister @zacklabadie This thesis so bullish", "url": "https://x.com/dino_kun1n9/status/2083325972519272549"}], "mentions": 200}, {"id": "uniswap-pools-cca", "title": "Uniswap Pools/CCA on Robinhood", "status": "HOT", "summary": "Uniswap CCA auction launchpad infra live on RH Chain; pools.trade frontend up, 'Coming soon'. v2/v3/v4/X deployed. Continuous Clearing Auctions auto-seed V4 pools. Meta driving all RH meme flow.", "queries": ["pools.trade", "robinhood chain uniswap"], "tokens": [{"sym": "FRONG", "ca": "0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47", "who": "Track frontend open, new CCA auctions, official Uni confirmations", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 7258, "transfers": 383926, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": 0}, "launch_n": 464, "just": "launch #464 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-30 20:16:59 UTC · created by 0xe1953702… · team-linked: zacklabadie (JWT-proven) · X-verified @zacklabadie (JWT in metadata)"}, {"sym": "UNICASH", "ca": "0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "who": "Track frontend open, new CCA auctions, official Uni confirmations", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 491, "transfers": 28131, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": 74}, "launch_n": 5, "just": "launch #5 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-13 15:30:40 UTC · created by 0xe2860139…"}, {"sym": "TRASH", "ca": "0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65", "who": "Track frontend open, new CCA auctions, official Uni confirmations", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 1711, "transfers": 119176, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": -3}, "launch_n": 9, "just": "launch #9 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-13 15:43:55 UTC · created by 0xf622c2f9…"}, {"sym": "CHWDR", "ca": "0xb358766827d7c704d3c52a57b5cf181d1b0ffc6c", "who": "Track frontend open, new CCA auctions, official Uni confirmations", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 897, "transfers": 26956, "d_holders": 1, "d_transfers": 7}, "launch_n": 474, "just": "launch #474 of the UERC20Factory · X-verified @zacklabadie (JWT in metadata)"}], "feed": [{"ts": "", "kind": "chain", "text": "Track frontend open, new CCA auctions, official Uni confirmations"}], "tweets": [{"id": "2084268199311487263", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "Showy005", "text": "我认为大家可能误解了 @0xSLK 的意思。\\n\\n他虽然没有推荐大家购买 $LEAK ，却也描述了 $LEAK 的价值。\\n\\n他引用自己之前对 https://t.co/kIhO9ZzGeC 的合约、launch model、FRONG/CHWDR 的深度拆解，然后直接提出一个明确问题——“X-verified Instant Launch 路径在官方 UI 还没正式上线的情况下，是否已经能在链上跑通？”\\n\\n他亲自部署了 $LEAK，证明这条路径已经可用，并且是第一个非同一钱包的独立验证部署者。\\n\\n他还反复强调这是 infrastructure POC，没有 utility、没有 roadmap、没有 creator allocation、没有捆绑买盘。这是一个有趣的社区实验。\\n\\n不仅如此，他还公开了自己的持仓约 13M，以及卖出计划（$1M MC 以上卖一半）、以及已经收到的 creator fee 情况。\\n\\n说实话，这是我看到质量比较高的一类 crypto 研究叙事——问题清晰、证据充分、行动验证、边界明确、利益公开。\\n\\n亮点不在“挖到了黑料”或“预测未来”，而在于把没有正式开放的基础设施路径跑通并公开验证，同时保持了少见的克制，不是单纯的制造fomo让散户购买，然后砸盘。\\n\\n我认为他是一名值得陪伴成长的dev，只要他言行一致。\\n\\nCA：0xa85bd69ea5492e42bb912a82b4feed6fe10d5e12", "url": "https://x.com/Showy005/status/2084268199311487263"}, {"id": "2084471418750960076", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "xdog_meme", "text": "Everyone thinks they're staring at each other.\\nThey're not.\\n🐸 Frong is watching https://t.co/jVmVhWWxib.\\n🐶 XDOG is waiting on @XLayerOfficial. https://t.co/xONaDzK2wz", "url": "https://x.com/xdog_meme/status/2084471418750960076"}, {"id": "2084483921216237665", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "OdailyChina", "text": "Uniswap @Uniswap  创始人 @haydenzadams  ：https://t.co/7NtxkFjl1m将很快向用户开放\\n\\n🦄 目前X上的散户已经非常期待Uniswap 能够统治 Robinhood Chain 的 Launchpad 赛道\\n\\n根据kol @the_smart_ape 的数据分析🧐(仅供参考意见)，对比了 7 月 1 日以来 Robinhood Chain @RobinhoodCrypto  上的所有 Launchpad 数据：\\n\\n1. 发射数量 🆚 7 天活存率\\n各平台已发行的代币总量与 7 天后仍有交易量的代币占比：\\n\\nPONS @ponsdotfamily：已发 240,996 个 ｜ 活存率 19.6%\\n\\nFLAP @flapdotsh：已发 151,952 个 ｜ 活存率仅 0.07%（15W+ 中仅 108 个还活着）\\n\\nNOXA @Noxa_Fi：已发 59,553 个 ｜ 活存率 2.1%\\n\\nCLANKER @clanker_world：已发 14,174 个 ｜ 活存率 1.6%\\n\\nLONG @longdotxyz：已发 6,053 个 ｜ 活存率 2.8%\\n\\nUNISWAP @Uniswap：仅发 872 个 ｜ 活存率高达 43.1%！ 🎯\\n\\n 2. 机制弥补：Dev 根本无法 Rug\\n\\nLong 平台：给 Dev 支付的是代币本身。\\n\\nUniswap：只给 Dev 支付 ETH,链上实测已有 6,265,547 个代币被作为手续费扣除，且 100% 全部重新注回池子，Dev 拿到的代币数是 零。 \\n👉 Dev 根本无法砸盘（Rug），因为手头没币；想要获利只能跟普通散户一样在公开市场买入\\n\\n⚠️ 3. 其他 Launchpads 的暗藏风险\\n\\nFlap：可升级代理合约，管理员可随时更改合约逻辑。\\nNoxa：代码豁免部署者首块购买限制（内置抢跑夹子）；自 7/11 停止新发，但靠 cashcat 周交易量仍有 $12.7 亿（是其他活跃平台总和的 5 倍！）。\\n\\nPons：控制手续费且可关停发射；7月被爆“非托管”私钥以可解密形式放在 Supabase 后端。\\n\\nLong：每笔抽取 1.7% 杂费，且完全没有任何 Docs 文档。\\n\\nUniswap：流动性锁在无所有者合约，代码写死 \\Irrecoverable by design\\\"，5 次审计，开源且发射成本仅 $0.0002b\"", "url": "https://x.com/OdailyChina/status/2084483921216237665"}, {"id": "2084484327937626230", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "NFTAlphaSociety", "text": "@QuietMotion__ @TheUniswapDogRH The other one isn’t a https://t.co/Ytf99hb9B5 token the 14day one &amp; btw people know about Uniswaps founder’s dog he posted it since 2020", "url": "https://x.com/NFTAlphaSociety/status/2084484327937626230"}, {"id": "2084497271316771268", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "btc2ai", "text": "$FRONG\\n\\n0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47\\n\\n踩在两个合力点上：\\n1）uniswap的hook V4今年持续创新也火，就是uni发起的。\\n\\n2）RH的发射台是百团大战，RH链急需一个有官方背书沉淀的发射、SWAP 多功能聚合平台。\\n\\n而作承载 @Uniswap 新产品 https://t.co/brKf8fDCaY 出圈吉祥物、青蛙IP、RH上的 $Pepe，加上多证据链确认这个ca uni 产品设计师部署。10M相信不会远。", "url": "https://x.com/btc2ai/status/2084497271316771268"}, {"id": "2084500567620198685", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "LEEJETJET", "text": "Có gì phía sau câu chuyện của $FRONG ?\\n\\nMemecoin này đang tăng trưởng khá nóng, vừa phá ATH và hiện tại đang ở mức 5.75M Mcap\\n\\nMột vài điểm đáng lưu ý:\\n- Hayden Adams đã xác nhận https://t.co/bbmu6c7rTa – sản phẩm mới của Uniswap sẽ sớm ra mắt.\\n\\n- Sau V4 Hooks, Uniswap được cho là vẫn đang tiếp tục mở rộng hệ sinh thái với những sản phẩm mới.\\n\\n- Cộng đồng đã chia sẻ nhiều phân tích on-chain cho rằng địa chỉ triển khai $FRONG có thể liên quan đến một số ví của đội ngũ phát triển sản phẩm Uniswap. Tuy nhiên, đến thời điểm hiện tại vẫn chưa có xác nhận chính thức.\\n\\n- Bên cạnh đó, cũng có nhiều thesis cho rằng nếu https://t.co/bbmu6c7rTa trở thành một mảnh ghép quan trọng trên Robinhood Chain, những dự án được thị trường chú ý từ sớm như $FRONG có thể sẽ được hưởng lợi.\\n\\nNFA, always DYOR", "url": "https://x.com/LEEJETJET/status/2084500567620198685"}, {"id": "2084504898457202972", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "CryptoHoldiT", "text": "$UNIFROG - The one you need to buy before uniswap Pools launches \\nThis is after a ton of research! \\nSo the one listed in https://t.co/SNSbo0O2NJ is \\n0x8750dA3e48345Ec0C5AAAACfcda2A004Da3B60c2\\n\\nThe other one that ppl say it was launched first was launched on a actions contract and will not be visible in pools... I'm switching 👍", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoHoldiT/status/2084504898457202972"}, {"id": "2084510620276404363", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "CryptoHoldiT", "text": "@ThanhCryptoBnb @Uniswap Bro the 9818 was deployed under a different contract and will not show up on https://t.co/ZmnFpy6Vzr when launched- plus us bundled over 30%... Pick your horse", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoHoldiT/status/2084510620276404363"}, {"id": "2084510663737741497", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "petsreid_", "text": "Aped $unifrog\\n\\nToken pertama dari https://t.co/3fbZXEWhhK.\\n\\nBiasanya yg pertama tamaa gni terbang.\\n\\nYuk ath lgi bisa kali.\\n\\n0x8750dA3e48345Ec0C5AAAACfcda2A004Da3B60c2 https://t.co/3tKHJR9JYo", "url": "https://x.com/petsreid_/status/2084510663737741497"}, {"id": "2084238062419083391", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "suskuntxt", "text": "Og\\nCa\\n\\n0x6A65Ec9022916E8c3Ec6bf1c4312966156326Bc2\\n\\nhttps://t.co/xROQuqWmih comingsoon", "url": "https://x.com/suskuntxt/status/2084238062419083391"}, {"id": "2084139140506120379", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "Auduoduo", "text": "Uniswap @Uniswap 的启动平台\\n\\n文章开篇先说两个概念：\\n*   Frong = 绑定曲线 (Bonding Curve)\\n*   Unicash = CCA (拍卖)\\n\\n正如推文中详细说明的那样，https://t.co/z780OYeIvT 预计将作为一个类似于 PumpFun 的代币启动平台。\\n\\n代币启动方式主要有两种：\\n1）使用传统的 CCA（Constant Constant Auction）机制，在特定时间内以拍卖方式进行；\\n2）类似于 PONS 和 PumpFun，通过绑定曲线，当募集到 50,000 美元的资金时，代币就会启动。\\n\\n虽然第一种方式原本就存在，但这次似乎是想通过第二种方式，正式推出代币启动平台\\n\\n三天前，FRONG 代币（第二种方式，使用绑定曲线）和 CHWDR 代币（第一种方式，使用 CCA）同时发行，并且由 Uniswap 的开发者发布，这在发布当天引起了关注（可能只是用于测试）。Uniswap 提供了登录 X 账号的功能，可以验证代币是由特定用户发行的，并且这些代币与 Uniswap 产品设计师 zack 的账号相关联。\\n\\n今天，在 Uniswap 的启动页面上，FRONG 的启动页面显示为 \\uniswap-bonding-curve\\\"，导致价格再次上涨（现在在 Front 页面上已经看不到）。\\n\\n在 Uniswap SDK 的 GitHub 仓库中，可以发现关于使用绑定曲线方式启动代币的 \\\"InstantLaunchStrategy\\\" 策略，以及与 Robinhood Chain 4663 相关的更新\"", "url": "https://x.com/Auduoduo/status/2084139140506120379"}, {"id": "2083485055603908676", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "AntCaveClub", "text": "真是百台大战了...\\n\\nUniswap 好像要发一个“台子聚合终端”  @Uniswap \\n\\n已经在官网上线链接， 还没开放功能。\\n\\n这应该算是正规军了。\\n\\n官网首页横幅处：点击就跳转到 PoolsTrade 了\\n\\nhttps://t.co/c9hqnG6X1r\\n\\n打开之后， 就是下面这个网站：\\n\\nhttps://t.co/yz0B3elLkR\\n\\n目前冷启动， 几乎无人关注。\\n\\n先关注这个了： @pools_trade\\n\\n官方DEV（之前不是UNI袜子🧦的地址） 还部署了一个测试代币：\\n\\n$CROAK\\n\\n0x4a8c4615ef620c767c8fe19f4b8afd5b16238b48\\n\\n官方也声明是测试代币了。\\n\\n不过之前 Uniswap 的测试袜子也被炒过。\\n\\n上线的时候， 应该会有机会， 可以先保持关注。", "url": "https://x.com/AntCaveClub/status/2083485055603908676"}, {"id": "2084242134207726048", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "ts65855", "text": "https://t.co/ojpxJ3Rxw8 这个平台的InstantLaunchStrategy模式第一个币\\n0xf1bf52e00bf5601eaa7d5f4b490273721e6cbd11", "url": "https://x.com/ts65855/status/2084242134207726048"}, {"id": "2084454381890719965", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "mrtdlgc", "text": "y'all degens wanted https://t.co/NAyLlD0V90 before it is live. he gave you the frontend.\\nyeah, just like y'all experimenting with new stuff. builders experiment with them too.", "url": "https://x.com/mrtdlgc/status/2084454381890719965"}, {"id": "2084455345317937170", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "0xpunklemonade", "text": "My gamble rn is that Uniswap https://t.co/fL4hvnRwNJ is a launchpad and will take all the liquidity in the market nuking every other coins on every other chains, bought some $frong and $liluni to position for it, also will be interesting to scoop some dips afterwards", "url": "https://x.com/0xpunklemonade/status/2084455345317937170"}, {"id": "2084474679301988619", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "BigBear0nTop", "text": "$UNICAT is the very first uniswap cat token on the https://t.co/b60sUtU27o launchpad sitting at 6k mc. Looks like a hidden gem\\n\\n0x28410022489E35030E4a73d50C2bC03EA5082A06 https://t.co/p3HGdZDhxG", "url": "https://x.com/BigBear0nTop/status/2084474679301988619"}, {"id": "2084477161872982237", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "ThanhCryptoBnb", "text": "Không gì qua mắt được các thám tử code check.\\nCâu chuyện là @Uniswap lộ nền tảng launch meme https://t.co/h38y1oAVVz trên Robinhood\\n- Các pháp sư đào được 1 con $frong vì cho rằng nó là con đầu tiên \\n=> cap hiện tại 7m\\nHôm nay thêm 1 pháp sư tìm ra được mấy con đầu tiên trong code.\\nCon meme đầu tiên được xác định lại là $Unifrog có CA: \\n0x12BC14C180c8A46a34177ec6126B7209ad9A9818", "url": "https://x.com/ThanhCryptoBnb/status/2084477161872982237"}, {"id": "2084479009425891330", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "NFTAlphaSociety", "text": "@QuietMotion__ @TheUniswapDogRH 0xbcA2f7789815d7cf627A60e85f615532efB3BE96 \\n\\nLong story short this is the token that was launched from https://t.co/Ytf99hb9B5", "url": "https://x.com/NFTAlphaSociety/status/2084479009425891330"}, {"id": "2084482063361794173", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "OdailyChina", "text": "🔥Uniswap @Uniswap  或将在Robinhood Chain @RobinhoodApp  推出代币发行平台Pools，基础设施已上线\\n\\n据加密 KOL 0xSLK @0xSLK  披露，Uniswap 正在 Robinhood Chain 开发名为「Pools」的代币发行平台，目前官网已上线但产品尚未开放。https://t.co/7NtxkFjl1m 页面显示「Coming soon from Uniswap」，并播放一段青蛙🐸跳入池塘的视频。\\n\\n研究发现，Pools 相关前端代码已包含大量产品信息，其内部名称为「Pools - create a token on Robinhood Chain」。其中「rh-cca」路径被认为与 Robinhood Chain 及 Uniswap 的 Continuous Clearing Auction（CCA）机制有关。公开代码显示，Pools 预计提供两种代币发行模式：\\n\\n1️⃣· Crowd Launch：采用 4 小时拍卖机制，固定供应 10 亿枚代币，其中 50% 用于拍卖，剩余 50% 及募集资金用于建立 Uniswap v4 流动性池。若达到 5 万美元 FDV 目标，代币将完成迁移并开放交易；否则参与者可退款。\\n\\n2️⃣· Instant Launch：类似 Bonding Curve 模式，用户可立即交易，80% 代币用于曲线交易，剩余 20% 及资金用于流动性建设，达到 5 万美元 FDV 后完成迁移。\\n\\n目前，Pools 相关链上基础设施已部署至 Robinhood Chain。Uniswap 官方文档显示，相关合约包括 CCA Factory、LiquidityLauncher 和 LBPStrategy 等。数据显示，相关合约已产生数百次拍卖事件，并完成数百个代币创建及迁移。\\n\\n与此同时，市场已出现多个借用 Pools 概念的代币。研究者指出，⚠️🚨目前并不存在官方 POOLS 代币，任何以 Pools、https://t.co/7NtxkFjl1m 或 UniFrog 命名的代币均未获得 Uniswap Labs 确认。\\n\\n其中，Meme 币  $FRONG（市值今晨短时突破 700 万美元，24 小时涨超 90%）因采用与 Pools 宣传视频类似的青蛙形象受到关注，但其仍只是社区发行代币，并非 Uniswap 官方项目。目前市场关注 Uniswap 后续是否会正式开放 https://t.co/7NtxkFjl1m、公布首个官方发行项目，以及发布经过验证的官方合约地址。", "url": "https://x.com/OdailyChina/status/2084482063361794173"}, {"id": "2082957745389490442", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "slaythisquant", "text": "@haydenzadams what is https://t.co/9Rl61YcFJf", "url": "https://x.com/slaythisquant/status/2082957745389490442"}, {"id": "2082933411161965028", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "trenchdiver", "text": "The first token deployed on Uniswap's https://t.co/ci6l8XLr2N bonding curve is $CASH\\n\\n0xca651c0100ddccc8c55935b53584cf1ef21e8c33 https://t.co/HxrHlZTzgR", "url": "https://x.com/trenchdiver/status/2082933411161965028"}, {"id": "2082869155410088182", "q": "pools.trade", "author": " follow live prices", "text": "@Uniswap  has a launchpad coming. Everything below is public right now.\\n\\nThe domain: https://t.co/ywd69xW25A. Meta description reads \\Coming soon from Uniswap.\\\" Page is noindex/nofollow - just a video and \\\"Coming soon.\\\"\\n\\nThe manifest at /manifest.webmanifest isn't gated:\\n\\n\\\"Pools - create a token on @RobinhoodApp  Chain\\\"\\n\\\"Create and trade tokens on Robinhood Chain. Launch with a crowd-priced auction or an instant pool", "url": "https://x.com/ follow live prices/status/2082869155410088182"}, {"id": "2083350915059458277", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "something_labs", "text": "这篇文章是作者@0xSLK对 https://t.co/NI2oHaBC70 的深度调研分析\\n\\n先说结论：\\n\\nPools 很可能是 Uniswap 即将在 Robinhood Chain 上推出的官方消费级代币发射台（launchpad）\\n\\n相关链上基础设施已经上线并运行，但产品本身还没正式开放，也没有官方 $POOLS 代币。\\n\\n核心发现拆解\\n\\nhttps://t.co/FV67sLP5bd 是什么？\\n\\n官网目前只是一个极简的“Coming soon from Uniswap”页面，配了一段夜视青蛙（frog）视频（路径名还带 rh-cca/frong.mp4）。域名 2026 年 7 月 17 日刚注册，视频时间戳是 7 月 28 日，并且设置了 noindex（故意不让搜索引擎收录）。\\n\\n作者从公开客户端代码、内部字符串、负载均衡器命名等线索推断：RH = Robinhood，CCA = Continuous Clearing Auction（Uniswap 的持续清算拍卖机制）。\\n\\n三个概念要分清  Launches：已经上线的 Uniswap 发现页（https://t.co/38t2xae59B），只是聚合第三方发射台的代币。  \\nPools：Uniswap 自己做的、面向普通用户的代币创建/发射/交易应用，专门跑在 Robinhood Chain 上。  \\nCCA：底层的链上拍卖与价格发现引擎，最终会把流动性迁移到 Uniswap v4。\\n\\n产品已经暴露出的具体设计（来自公开客户端代码）\\n\\n客户端里有大量 rhcca.* 字符串，直接描述了产品流程：\\n\\nCrowd Launch（众筹发射）：固定 4 小时拍卖，总量 10 亿枚。一半用于拍卖，一半 + 筹集资金进入永久锁定的流动性。毕业门槛是 5 万美元 FDV。失败可全额退款。采用时间加权出价，降低捆绑攻击。\\n\\nInstant Launch（即时发射）：类似常见的 bonding curve，交易立刻开始。80% 供应在曲线上，20% + 资金进流动性。同样 5 万美元 FDV 毕业，无时间限制。\\n\\n其他细节：支持 ETH / USDG 支付、可选验证创建者 X 账号、0.25% 池子手续费、创建者可拿 0.05% LP 费用。\\n\\n链上基础设施已经活了\\n\\nUniswap 官方文档里已经公开了 Robinhood Chain 上的 Liquidity Launchpad 合约（CCA Factory、LiquidityLauncher、LBPStrategy 等），部署时间在 7 月 6–10 日（比域名还早）。\\n\\n作者扫描时，已经有约 485 个拍卖、700+ 个代币创建、100+ 次迁移。这些合约是无许可的，所以链上已经充满测试、垃圾和仿盘。\\n\\n早期代币信号与风险  \\n\\n最干净的信号是 FRONG 和 CHWDR：同一个与 Uniswap 设计师 Zack Labadie 关联的钱包，先做 Instant Launch（图片就是青蛙），22 分钟后再做 Crowd Launch，并吸引了约 43.8 万美元出价。看起来像官方在测试两条路径。 \\n \\n还有一些“历史第一”：UNICASH（第一个成功迁移的 Crowd Launch）、UNICORN、ABE 等。\\n  \\n大量仿盘已经出现：各种 $POOLS、$FRONG、UniFrog 等，有的已经收了几千美元，有的被标记为垃圾。\\n\\n作者强调：Pools 是产品名，不是代币名。在官方通过 https://t.co/NI2oHaBC70、博客或账号公布地址之前，任何 $POOLS 都是非官方的。\\n\\n作者的最终判断与观察清单\\n\\n产品看起来已经很接近发布：域名、开发环境、客户端文案、合约全都到位了，但还没有正式上线日期、官方首发代币或官方地址。真正可靠的信号是： \\n\\nPools 出现在 Uniswap 的 launchpad API 里；  \\nhttps://t.co/NI2oHaBC70 去掉 noindex 并换成真实应用；  \\nUniswap 公布第一个 Crowd Launch 地址；  \\n官方验证的账号通过官方合约创建拍卖。\\n\\n————————————————————\\n\\n目前看比较有希望的两个ca\\n\\nFRONG，已经回调到2m（0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47）\\n\\nUnicash，赔率可以\\n（0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1）", "url": "https://x.com/something_labs/status/2083350915059458277"}, {"id": "2084236259354898531", "q": "pools.trade", "author": "biiiiymeister", "text": "Another Alpha ⤵️\\n\\nhttps://t.co/6uVNLYGPt5\\n\\n$POOLS \\n\\nbonded first auction token 3 days ago\\n\\nhttps://t.co/gISVwbmqfA\\n\\nSitting at $7K\\n\\nthis is going to $M \\n\\nChange my mind\\n\\nI proofed $FRONG and $CHWDR \\n\\n$POOL real auction CA is\\n0x6a65ec9022916e8c3ec6bf1c4312966156326bc2\\n\\nIt's bonded\\nCheck here.\\nhttps://t.co/6uVNLYGPt5", "url": "https://x.com/biiiiymeister/status/2084236259354898531"}, {"id": "2084378947777667186", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "LuffyCallz", "text": "https://t.co/NWnhO34TqW\\n\\napparently this is the 1st token from @Uniswap new https://t.co/phPHvyZhYZ\\n\\naped", "url": "https://x.com/LuffyCallz/status/2084378947777667186"}, {"id": "2084454305319547129", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "bankrbot", "text": "@eazyfool TELEBAN on robinhood chain is looking rough, down 25.73% in 24h! price: $0.0000001115, mcap: $10,109.84, vol: $1,271.81. check your wallet activity for latest updates!", "url": "https://x.com/bankrbot/status/2084454305319547129"}, {"id": "2084473665199169743", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "kikiviell", "text": "gm, guysss\\n\\neven while i was asleep, robinhood chain fomo kept moving\\n\\ntime to lock in again letsgooo", "url": "https://x.com/kikiviell/status/2084473665199169743"}, {"id": "2084429307045167564", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "timthedrummer", "text": "@PatronReRenaiss Is this Robin Hood chain? Or Solana?", "url": "https://x.com/timthedrummer/status/2084429307045167564"}, {"id": "2084458718876574002", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "marcushan_", "text": "ALPHA: the first prediction market on Robinhood Chain just spawned.\\n\\nFollowing early before CT finds it and turns the points leaderboard into a full-time job.", "url": "https://x.com/marcushan_/status/2084458718876574002"}, {"id": "2084469586465022048", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "AstraXLabs", "text": "@RobinhoodApp Robinhood chain moving fast. The UX is finally catching up to the vision. Stay bullish.", "url": "https://x.com/AstraXLabs/status/2084469586465022048"}, {"id": "2084447613143978054", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "13emma3785", "text": "������ MIKE TYSON BITES ($MTB) is LIVE!\\n\\nThe most legendary bite in boxing history… now on-chain. ������������\\n\\nCommunity-driven meme on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nBuy before the next round begins.\\n\\n������ $MTB\\n\\nhttps://t.co/p9TFNkNWUd", "url": "https://x.com/13emma3785/status/2084447613143978054"}, {"id": "2084424980213662208", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "UFOvnis11", "text": "������ New launch on PenkPad!\\nPEPE BURN HOOD ($PEPEBURN20)\\n⛓ Chain: Robinhood Chain\\n������ Supply: 1B\\n������ Creator bought: 6.07M (0.61%)\\n������ LP Locker: ✅ (curve liquidity locked by protocol)\\n������ CA: 0x0b135cb3d7cb09fb06df4f9808cb1226ab45da01\\nTrade on PenkPad · Explorer", "url": "https://x.com/UFOvnis11/status/2084424980213662208"}, {"id": "2084464263083467009", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "anyaforger999", "text": "ALPHA: the first prediction market on Robinhood Chain just spawned.\\n\\nFollowing early before CT finds it and turns the points leaderboard into a full-time job.", "url": "https://x.com/anyaforger999/status/2084464263083467009"}, {"id": "2084427982932791746", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "trenchdiver", "text": "This note is false. https://t.co/N78pwUz3z8 was linked directly from Uniswap’s website as its upcoming token launchpad.\\n\\nListLaunches is an endpoint for the launchpad’s not-yet-public API, so it would not be expected to appear in Uniswap’s existing developer documentation. Comparing it to the general pool-data API or ETH/USDC rankings is therefore irrelevant.", "url": "https://x.com/trenchdiver/status/2084427982932791746"}, {"id": "2084318191447380415", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "dex_kolwatcher", "text": "Detect PAID DEXScreener: $ABE ������\\n                                                                     UNISWAP ROBINHOOD\\nCA: 0xC9762A64678765043Dc9142D7713cD3bEb842Dd6\\n\\nVolumeBuy 24H:  $19,810  | VolumSell 24H:  $16,001 \\nLiquid:  $11,380 | MC:  $16,768\\n\\nCheck Chart Buy ������ https://t.co/2lcEzgUA3Z", "url": "https://x.com/dex_kolwatcher/status/2084318191447380415"}, {"id": "2084406663558332823", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "ConvictionMM", "text": "When a real team with a proven DeFi track record finally launches something, CT somehow decides that's the one to fade.\\n\\nThe founder of @Uniswap, Hayden Adams, just confirmed that https://t.co/KR1z3101lZ is coming soon.\\n\\nThe leading memecoin on the platform, $FRONG, launched by the Uniswap team, is still sitting at roughly a $5M market cap.\\n\\nI've been telling my followers to buy since ~$300K, and I'll keep saying the same thing until the market catches up.\\n\\nSometimes the highest-conviction trade isn't the loudest narrative. It's backing builders with a history of shipping.", "url": "https://x.com/ConvictionMM/status/2084406663558332823"}, {"id": "2084402479085531330", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Viraltbh", "text": "������ BREAKING: Uniswap founder Hayden Adams says \\npools are coming “very soon.”\\n\\nhttps://t.co/Z84yGPeOLS says “coming soon.”\\n\\nThe pond is waking up. ������\\n\\n$FRONG. Ribbit. https://t.co/FILc3mIEY8", "url": "https://x.com/Viraltbh/status/2084402479085531330"}, {"id": "2084423473720332797", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0FJAKE", "text": "i wish nothing but the best for all the cat coins, dog coins, app coins, stock coins, and all the other coins on the robinhood chain\\n\\nthey are not our competition\\n\\nthere is only room for one mascot\\n\\ndon’t mid curve this\\n\\nthe hood stays on https://t.co/OmJy91GWPp", "url": "https://x.com/0FJAKE/status/2084423473720332797"}, {"id": "2084467656036401470", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0x_gemss", "text": "������ DEX PAID SIGNAL\\n\\nNASDANQ\\nChain: UNISWAP ROBINHOOD\\nMC: $2661 | Liquidity: $0\\n\\nCA:\\n0x51Fb76BE80ab6daAa345D818f4E06441816b4fEa\\n\\nCheck Chart - Signal: https://t.co/A36AoNOSUo", "url": "https://x.com/0x_gemss/status/2084467656036401470"}, {"id": "2084447505593581694", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "AcervoCheemsito", "text": "$cheems on Robinhood Chain \\n\\nThis isn't even the Vlad candle btw https://t.co/wWkKwbjRud", "url": "https://x.com/AcervoCheemsito/status/2084447505593581694"}, {"id": "2084448841068114056", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "13emma3785", "text": "������ THE BITE IS BACK… THIS TIME ON-CHAIN. ������\\n\\nMike Tyson Bites ($MTB) has officially launched on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nThis is a community-driven meme inspired by one of the most unforgettable moments in boxing history.\\n\\nIf you’re into memes, crypto, and being early on new projects, come check it out and join the community.\\n\\n������ Mike Tyson Bites ($MTB)\\n\\n������ https://t.co/NEB51Wwo6Y\\n\\n������ Follow us on X:\\n@MTysonbites\\n\\n#MikeTysonBites #MTB #RobinhoodChain #HoodFun #Crypto #MemeCoin #CryptoCommunity #Web3 #DeFi #MemeToken #Boxing #MikeTyson #Altcoins #OnChain #LaunchDay", "url": "https://x.com/13emma3785/status/2084448841068114056"}, {"id": "2084436469515760095", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "jscrypto4882", "text": "Holy candles!\\n\\nIt's like people finally realizing which doggo was destined to be the main PVE runner of Robinhood Chain all along.\\n\\n$cheems https://t.co/Qqz30MiDq7", "url": "https://x.com/jscrypto4882/status/2084436469515760095"}, {"id": "2084318919293341835", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "BAYCBoshi", "text": "Wave 3 of Robinhood chain began today.", "url": "https://x.com/BAYCBoshi/status/2084318919293341835"}, {"id": "2084380825437540381", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "beejorn", "text": "Uniswap ($UNI) is now the primary public AMM on Robinhood Chain, with v2, v3, v4 and UniswapX deployed. \\n\\n#DeFi", "url": "https://x.com/beejorn/status/2084380825437540381"}, {"id": "2076835001283543282", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "timtung_eth", "text": "Uniswap 官方把 CCA 拍卖发币平台搬上 Robinhood Chain ������\\n\\nCCA（Continuous Clearing Auction）不是比 Gas、比手速，而是让所有人在一段时间内一起竞价，再统一成交价格，降低 Bot 狙击、MEV 与抢跑，最后自动建立 Uniswap V4 流动池并锁定 LP\\n\\n昨晚跑出来的几个值得关注的几个代币������\\n\\n������️ $TRASH（目前龙头）\\n0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n������ $UNICASH（首个公开拍卖代币）\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n������ $UNICORN（官方示范代币）\\n0x5f94e24a3293cf12c97d8b21c2f960adf471c951\\n\\n@RobinhoodCrypto 最近几乎每天都有新叙事，@Uniswap 现在在RBH链最大的竞争对象@Noxa_Fi ，但两者基本上不在一个量级，CCA很可能会成为未来新专案发币的新标准之一", "url": "https://x.com/timtung_eth/status/2076835001283543282"}, {"id": "2076853776863178946", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "TriXina731", "text": "$WISHBONE  640k➡10m\\n$HOODIE  dev持续建设   我还拿着 耐心等花开\\n$wsb 没有认领 \\n\\n这段时间在外边旅游只有一块屏幕好不方便\\n过几天回家\\n最近主要是看二段，上午和晚上 18 点后看看打新\\n昨晚主要是 rh 链的新平台 uniswap 打新，倍数还可以\\n\\n$unicorn uni 台子的演示币\\n$trash 链上 rwa+创始人提及 \\n$unicash 新平台第一个币\\n\\nrh 链得跟老外玩\\n别听国人瞎 fomo 去追高\\n可能他们自己都没有搞清楚状况\\n太多次了给我整无语了\\n理性评判还要被骂 lol\\n交易得相信自己\\n屏蔽噪音\\n所谓的确定性机会其实并非表面所见\\n有时也是散户 yy 盘•ᴗ•\\n\\n0x77581054581b9c525e7dd7a0155de43867532d03\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n0x5f94e24a3293cf12c97d8b21c2f960adf471c951\\n0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65", "url": "https://x.com/TriXina731/status/2076853776863178946"}, {"id": "2083616599697670257", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "kranalicio", "text": "If, like me, you’ve been waiting for the new @uniswap platform for @robinhoodApp, take a look here.\\nUniswap has already launched it, and you can see that the first coin to have its curve completed was $unicash.\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\nhttps://t.co/klfdIWUKuP https://t.co/sxXI51eYj9", "url": "https://x.com/kranalicio/status/2083616599697670257"}, {"id": "2084423551226990755", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "thehoodstayson", "text": "i wish nothing but the best for all the cat coins, dog coins, app coins, stock coins, and all the other coins on the robinhood chain\\n\\nthey are not our competition\\n\\nthere is only room for one mascot\\n\\ndon’t mid curve this\\n\\nthe hood stays on https://t.co/OmJy91GWPp", "url": "https://x.com/thehoodstayson/status/2084423551226990755"}, {"id": "2084419887632433214", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Degendefi02", "text": "alpha on Robinhood: $CATSTR\\n\\nletscash first released this dividend token before $CASHCAT launchpad\\n\\n@cashcatstrat https://t.co/2UL2Ks0mzL", "url": "https://x.com/Degendefi02/status/2084419887632433214"}, {"id": "2084400359561371672", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "harutin_io", "text": "������ FoxPad is LIVE on Robinhood Chain. ������\\n\\nhttps://t.co/fpB5krUQ63\\n\\nLaunch. Trade. Earn.\\nEarn 20% in referral fees.\\n50% of platform fees go back to $FOX. https://t.co/sCNQ8BGCNz", "url": "https://x.com/harutin_io/status/2084400359561371672"}, {"id": "2084387481529593961", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Alex_2avc", "text": "Early Alpha\\n\\n@NullSaintsxyz  - stealth mint on Robinhood Chain\\nSub 100 followers\\n\\nFollow and turn notis on, they can drop mint link at any time https://t.co/wTQLDVjVH8", "url": "https://x.com/Alex_2avc/status/2084387481529593961"}, {"id": "2084412690437476801", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "hodlinsky", "text": "What if $CASHCAT becomes the biggest meme on Robinhood? https://t.co/nxe9tmI6Jt", "url": "https://x.com/hodlinsky/status/2084412690437476801"}, {"id": "2084394424985907656", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Tajudeen", "text": "trenching on robinhood be like. https://t.co/yTpANOPUQm", "url": "https://x.com/Tajudeen/status/2084394424985907656"}, {"id": "2084389846739767794", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "DejaVu1200", "text": "A chain is only as strong as its community, and @GremlinRH is building the most passionate tribe on Robinhood Chain. Driven by creativity, culture, and curiosity, the cartel is setting the gold standard for what the next big thing should look like.", "url": "https://x.com/DejaVu1200/status/2084389846739767794"}, {"id": "2084454772376264786", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "alexmccurryo", "text": "I’m convinced the next $1B runner on Robinhood will be a stock coin or a cat.", "url": "https://x.com/alexmccurryo/status/2084454772376264786"}, {"id": "2084457860201861170", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "bankrbot", "text": "@eazyfool @naminonami1 $TELEBAN just dropped on robinhood chain! check your wallet activity for the new tokens. price: $0.0000001115, 24h change: -25.73%, mcap: $10.11k, vol: $1.27k", "url": "https://x.com/bankrbot/status/2084457860201861170"}, {"id": "2084456517395509378", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "_xSalmane", "text": "Aped \\n\\nThe uniswap logo after the name means probably uniswap team ������\\n\\nI tried with random wallet, it showing nothing. \\n\\n0x597fb475DF08e99156b297971148148A295072d7\\n\\n19k https://t.co/OcM166lMaV", "url": "https://x.com/_xSalmane/status/2084456517395509378"}, {"id": "2084458835142709592", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "dex_kolwatcher", "text": "Detect PAID DEXScreener: $NVR ������\\n                                                                     UNISWAP ROBINHOOD\\nCA: 0x880B852316d430741C5B693AA53f22871e42eE77\\n\\nVolumeBuy 24H:  $767  | VolumSell 24H:  $1,175 \\nLiquid:  $1,479 | MC:  $113,842\\n\\nCheck Chart Buy ������ https://t.co/rzHeIEwvLe", "url": "https://x.com/dex_kolwatcher/status/2084458835142709592"}, {"id": "2084424077700125114", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "VANNIMALx", "text": "The year is 2026 we are building new technology on Robinhood Chain using Stock Tokens.\\n\\nClock in 2.0", "url": "https://x.com/VANNIMALx/status/2084424077700125114"}, {"id": "2084425074187128881", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0FJAKE", "text": "$HOODIE will be the bridge for retail.\\n\\nRobinhood App → Robinhood Chain", "url": "https://x.com/0FJAKE/status/2084425074187128881"}, {"id": "2084420161092592016", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Hannaninasuha", "text": "Tried prompting @heyaura on Robinhood Chain support. Swap, trade or bridge with plain English and it handles the rest. Wallet-native AI finally makes multi-chain less of a headache.", "url": "https://x.com/Hannaninasuha/status/2084420161092592016"}, {"id": "2084394012933496972", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Shams_Ali5", "text": "The next pixel movement starts here.\\n\\nRobinoids is coming to Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nNo promises. No noise. Just builders, collectors, and culture.\\n\\nLike ������ \\nRepost ������\\nDrop your wallet below for a chance to secure a GTD. https://t.co/8rnpC4thSu", "url": "https://x.com/Shams_Ali5/status/2084394012933496972"}, {"id": "2084441230411190369", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Cloroshi", "text": "Another robinhood $cheems ATH", "url": "https://x.com/Cloroshi/status/2084441230411190369"}, {"id": "2084417137913778322", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "whimsioracle", "text": "@camolNFT https://t.co/qeBI0UUbbs\\n\\nPump fun wannabe by the uniswap team", "url": "https://x.com/whimsioracle/status/2084417137913778322"}, {"id": "2084446054573871176", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "panik_eth", "text": "ABOUT UNIBOW 🦄🏹\\n\\nTL;DR: you asked for utility. UNIBOW NOW ALLOWS YOU TO LAUNCH ON UNISWAP CCA!\\n\\nhere's what happened: i like trying things and poking at systems just to see what happens.\\n\\ni could not wait for uniswap to open https://t.co/ioLKy72uA1. after seeing frong by a @uniswap product designer and leak by @0xSLK, i wanted to try the same path.\\n\\nonce https://t.co/ioLKy72uA1 is live, launching a token there will probably feel normal. i thought it would be more fun to be one of the first few.\\n\\nso this was never about farming traders. these launches use a 0.25% trading fee. by design, 100% of sell-side fees and 60% of buy-side fees go back into liquidity. the remaining 40% of buy-side fees goes to the creator.\\n\\nin other words, uniswap designed this system to keep growing liquidity, not to extract as much as possible from users.\\n\\nso why did i launch unibow?\\n\\nfor fun.\\n\\nusing a product before it has a public interface, and writing a few lines of code to make it work, is still very fun to me.\\n\\nthen around four people asked what my plans were for unibow. so i decided to turn it into a small launchpad before https://t.co/ioLKy72uA1 goes live.\\n\\nyes, i am trying to frontrun the uniswap interface. just for fun.\\n\\ni will not make money from the launchpad. i will not take a cut from anyone’s creator fees. everything will work the way uniswap designed it.\\n\\nthe only requirement is holding 500,000 $ubow.\\n\\nany wallet holding that amount will be able to add a name, symbol, description and image, then launch a token through the same uniswap path without even paying the gas fee. the wallet that launches the token will receive its creator fees.\\n\\ni would also love to hand the whole project over to a strong CTO team. i am happy to transfer the creator fees generated by $ubow to that team too.\\n\\nif you are that team, please dm me. i would love to give this weird little experiment a good home.", "url": "https://x.com/panik_eth/status/2084446054573871176"}, {"id": "2084446332249575684", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0xGoldilocks", "text": "Apparently @Uniswap is cooking up a launchpad\\n\\nhttps://t.co/po1vm9I47W\\n\\nRobinhood meme reneissance?", "url": "https://x.com/0xGoldilocks/status/2084446332249575684"}, {"id": "2084438757625762075", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0xtrabeze", "text": "What the hell happened to the RH trenches? Just a few weeks ago, it seemed like everybody and their mother bridged over to catch the hype. Now? It seems like everyone is either waiting for the https://t.co/WpvsAYtc32 or ponsv2 launch just to keep jeeting. Revive the trenches atp.", "url": "https://x.com/0xtrabeze/status/2084438757625762075"}, {"id": "2083741055770574996", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "rosetina_degen9", "text": "������ https://t.co/C1MiCTKraC is cooking.\\n\\nUniswap is quietly building its own consumer launchpad + trading terminal on Robinhood Chain, and the signals are stacking up hard.\\n\\nA two-week-old domain. A night-vision frog video named frong.mp4. Internal strings everywhere pointing to RH-CCA (Robinhood + Continuous Clearing Auction). Contracts already live for weeks. The product itself still “Coming soon.”\\n\\nThis is not some random vibe launchpad. This looks like @Uniswap’s official answer to the chaos currently dominating Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nWhat’s actually there\\n\\n➜ Two launch models already coded \\n- Crowd Launch: 4-hour time-weighted auction. 1B supply. Half sold in the auction, half + raised funds go into forever-locked liquidity. Graduates at $50k FDV. Same clearing price for everyone.  \\n- Instant Launch: Classic bonding-curve style. 80% on the curve, 20% + proceeds into LP. No hard deadline, same $50k graduation.\\n\\n➜ Infrastructure is live \\nCCA Factory, LiquidityLauncher, LBP strategies - all deployed and already processing hundreds of auctions and migrations. Permissionless. Anyone can use it right now.\\n\\n➜ The teaser site (https://t.co/5KUJ6q87mV) \\nSparse landing page, frog jumping into a pond, “Coming soon from Uniswap.” Domain registered mid-July. Video asset path literally called rh-cca/frong.mp4. Noindex for a reason.\\n\\n➜ It will also aggregate \\nPons, Bankr, Noxa, Long, Bow, Varo, letscash… one terminal for every launchpad on the chain. Makes sense when Robinhood Chain just printed massive volume in July.\\n\\nThe FRONG / CHWDR signal\\n\\n@zacklabadie (Uniswap Product Designer) is tied to this.  \\nSame wallet launched $FRONG (Instant) then CHWDR (Crowd).  \\n\\nFRONG:\\n0x6245e67affA44a23077f0Ea7f981a8DC743a0c47\\n\\nVideo upload metadata on the S3 bucket matches.  \\n@haydenzadams replied with a single ������ when asked what https://t.co/5KUJ6q87mV is.\\n\\nThese are clearly internal tests. Not official tokens. But the onchain + offchain breadcrumbs are clean.\\n\\nContracts people keep asking about\\n\\nCHWDR: 0xb358766827d7c704d3c52a57b5cf181d1b0ffc6c \\nUNIPOOLS (test only): 0x0e7895da46c5a4c030b37975584a61a06c8338f4\\n\\nNeither is the official Pools token. There is no official Pools token yet. Any ticker using “Pools”, “FRONG”, “PLS” right now is either test, copycat, or front-running.\\n\\nWhy this matters\\n\\nRobinhood Chain is already loud. Uniswap is the dominant liquidity layer. Now they’re building the native launchpad + terminal themselves with proper auction mechanics and locked liquidity.\\n\\nWhen the real product drops (https://t.co/5KUJ6q87mV goes live, first verified Crowd Launch, or official address published), the narrative is going to be loud.\\n\\nI’m watching for:  \\n- Pools appearing in the Uniswap app launchpad API  \\n- Teaser replaced with the actual interface  \\n- First official auction linked from https://t.co/5KUJ6q87mV or Uniswap accounts\\n\\nThis is early. Infra is ready. Product is not. Narrative is forming.\\n\\nHigh conviction watchlist. Not a buy signal on any current ticker.\\n\\nDYOR. Contracts change. Stories get front-run. Stay sharp.  \\n\\nNext 100x usually starts looking like this.", "url": "https://x.com/rosetina_degen9/status/2083741055770574996"}, {"id": "2084184477010694516", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "John_King_Kate", "text": "Uniswap’s Launchpad @Uniswap\\n\\nThe article starts by explaining two concepts:\\n. Frong = Bonding Curve\\n. Unicash = CCA (Auction)\\n\\nAs detailed in the tweet, https://t.co/0TztDLwhoW is expected to serve as a token launch platform similar to PumpFun.\\n\\nThere are mainly two ways to launch tokens:\\n\\n1: Using the traditional CCA (Constant Product Auction) mechanism, conducting an auction within a specific time period;\\n2:Similar to PONS and PumpFun, using a bonding curve — the token launches once $50,000 in funding is raised.\\n\\nAlthough the first method already existed, this time it seems they want to officially launch the token launchpad through the second method.\\n\\nThree days ago, the FRONG token (second method, using bonding curve) and the CHWDR token (first method, using CCA) were issued at the same time by Uniswap developers. This attracted attention on the day of release\\n\\n(possibly just for testing). Uniswap provides the ability to log in with an X account to verify that a token was issued by a specific user, and these tokens are linked to the account of Uniswap product designer Zack.\\n\\nToday, on Uniswap’s launch page, FRONG’s launch page shows “uniswap-bonding-curve,” which caused the price to rise again (it is no longer visible on the front page now).\\n\\nIn the Uniswap SDK GitHub repository, you can find the “InstantLaunchStrategy” for launching tokens via bonding curve, as well as updates related to Robinhood Chain 4663.", "url": "https://x.com/John_King_Kate/status/2084184477010694516"}, {"id": "2084255180254494821", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "BitStern", "text": "Alpha on Uniswap launchpad &amp; auction coins \\n\\nFRONG\\ndeployed by uni dev and hints at the upcoming launchpad side\\n$4M\\n\\nUNICASH\\nfirst auction coin listed on uni website\\n$100k\\n\\nCHWDR\\nthe very first token by uni dev\\n$350k\\n\\nmore info below\\n\\nwhich one will succeed? https://t.co/zkAKrBROTQ", "url": "https://x.com/BitStern/status/2084255180254494821"}, {"id": "2084255776231559536", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0xSLK", "text": "Follow-up to my https://t.co/kg484u2TR2 research.\\n\\nAfter digging through the public infrastructure behind Uniswap's upcoming launchpad, I wanted to answer one question: does the X-verified Instant Launch path already work outside the unreleased Pools UI?\\n\\nIt does.\\n\\nI used it to deploy THE LEAK ($LEAK) on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nCA: `0xa85Bd69EA5492e42bb912A82B4fEED6fe10D5e12`\\n\\nThe deployment is tied to @0xSLK and my deployer wallet through Uniswap's official X verification flow. The identity data stored with the launch matches the onchain transaction sender.\\n\\nAt the protocol level, $LEAK follows the same canonical deployment path as $FRONG. Both use the same official launch contracts, Instant strategy, supply model and v4 pool parameters. Their onchain receipts also pass the same structural verification.\\n\\nAt the time of deployment, Uniswap's public data showed only $FRONG and $CHWDR as X-verified launches across these new launch paths, both from the same wallet. LEAK became the first entry from a different verified deployer.\\n\\nThis was an infrastructure POC, not the beginning of a roadmap. There is no utility or promised product for $LEAK right now, and the launch itself included no creator allocation or bundled initial buy.\\n\\nDisclosure: as of posting, I hold approximately 13M LEAK. I currently plan to sell roughly half of that position if the token trades above a $1M market cap. Otherwise, I’m comfortable holding it and collecting creator fees, which have already exceeded my expectations for what started as a technical POC.\\n\\nI also built LaunchProof to track these deployments:\\n\\nhttps://t.co/cy0KghOpNX\\n\\nLaunchProof cross-checks Uniswap's launch data with onchain metadata and the transaction sender. It lets anyone inspect authenticated deployers without trusting a ticker, profile picture or narrative.\\n\\nOne important distinction: X verification establishes provenance. It does not prove that a token is safe, useful, official or worth buying.\\n\\nOnchain receipts:\\n\\n$LEAK\\nhttps://t.co/pDkeDsrYxL\\n\\n$FRONG\\nhttps://t.co/aaLu46eqAK", "url": "https://x.com/0xSLK/status/2084255776231559536"}, {"id": "2084198987687506107", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "09Llirik", "text": "Uniswap is currently actively developing a new token launch format on Robinhood Chain - Crowd Launch. \\n\\nHow it works in simple terms:\\n• The auction lasts 4 hours\\n• Total supply is 1 billion tokens\\n• Half (500 million) is sold in the auction\\n• The other half + all raised funds go straight into liquidity that is permanently locked  \\n\\nThere is a minimum threshold - around $50,000 in fully diluted valuation.\\nIf it’s not reached within 4 hours - everyone simply gets their money back and the token doesn’t launch.\\n\\nThe most important part:\\nAll buyers pay the same price. No advantages for bots or those who were early.\\n\\n$CHWDR was launched exactly in this mode - it’s being called the first Crowd meme.\\nOn-chain and off-chain traces show that the same wallet that launched $FRONG later launched $CHWDR.\\n\\nDoes this mean anything? \\nI don’t know.\\nWill the Uniswap team try to drive attention to Crowd Launch through interest in CHWDR? \\nI don’t know.\\n\\nStay sharp.", "url": "https://x.com/09Llirik/status/2084198987687506107"}, {"id": "2084331376376189138", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "cyberbulk911", "text": "@RobinhoodApp Core memory: finding high volumes launchpad on Robinhood", "url": "https://x.com/cyberbulk911/status/2084331376376189138"}], "mentions": 147}, {"id": "chwdr-zack-satellite", "title": "$CHWDR Zack test/satellite", "status": "WATCHING", "summary": "$CHWDR (897 holders, ~430-756K mc) also deployed by @zacklabadie — likely CCA test beside $FRONG. Fresh RH migration, 3 smart wallets in, TG live. Same-dev beta on FRONG strength.", "queries": ["$CHWDR", "zacklabadie"], "tokens": [{"sym": "CHWDR", "ca": "0xb358766827d7c704d3c52a57b5cf181d1b0ffc6c", "who": "Watch for Zack wallet activity and FRONG correlation pumps", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 897, "transfers": 26956