aring Auction（连续清算拍卖）。和「先到先得的抢购」不同，它把出价放在连续多个区块里一起撮合、清算出一个公平价。整套流程是这样的：\\n\\n第 1 步｜网页一键发币（无代码） — 发起方在 Uniswap 网页填参数，由工厂合约 UERC20Factory 部署一个 10 亿供应的 ERC-20，不用写任何代码。\\n\\n第 2 步｜连续清算拍卖定价 — 买家出价，系统在多个区块内持续撮合，得出统一清算价，而不是第一个区块被机器人狙走。这从根上压低了狙击盘和捆绑盘。\\n\\n第 3 步｜建 Uniswap V4 池子 — 拍卖募到的 ETH + 代币，注入一个 Uniswap V4（1% 费率）的 TOKEN/ETH 池子。池子里的 ETH 大头是买家的钱，不是 dev 的。\\n\\n第 4 步｜流动性自动锁定 — 代表这个池子的 LP 仓位（一个 NFT）被转进 UniV4PositionLocker 锁仓合约，dev 从此不再持有它。\\n\\n第 5 步｜dev 靠手续费赚钱 — dev 手里没有代币预留盘，改为收取每笔交易的 1% 手续费（以代币形式），领取后卖成 ETH。这是它的收入模型。\\n\\n人话总结：发币不用写代码；定价靠「大家一起拍」而不是「谁手快」；池子建好后钥匙被锁进保险柜，dev 拿不回来；dev 不靠砸盘赚钱，靠抽你 1% 的过路费。\\n\\n会不会RUG？\\n合约层调查：四个关键地址（你可以自己核对）\\n\\n光听宣传没用。我把这套机制涉及的核心合约全挖了出来，都能在 Robinhood 链的 Blockscout 浏览器上逐个核对：\\n\\n发币工厂 UERC20Factory：0x000000e200088d55c39a11f609e5f667729ad49b\\n　所有 auction 代币由它部署，是机制入口。\\n\\nUniswap V4 池子管理器 PoolManager：0x8366a39cc670b4001a1121b8f6a443a643e40951\\n　所有池子的流动性实际存在这里（它常年是各币的「第一大持有者」，那其实是池子本身，不是巨鲸，别看错）。\\n\\nV4 仓位管理器 PositionManager (POSM)：0x58daec3116aae6d93017baaea7749052e8a04fa7\\n　每个池子的流动性用一个 NFT 表示，谁持有这个 NFT，谁就能撤流动性。\\n\\n流动性锁仓合约 UniV4PositionLocker：0x67551ce34ece44980c310838b391fb3ece7a7d15\\n　关键防 rug 部件。LP 仓位 NFT 被锁进这里，dev 交出控制权。\\n\\n保证了公平性，不会有池子RUG的情况，但是Dev会有源源不断的交易手续费，难免出现Dev会持续有一点点抛压。\\n\\n标的一：TRASH —— 跑出来的龙头\\n\\n合约：0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n发文时1.1M市值，把霉霉演唱会卖垃圾的叙事融合进来，加上Uniswap 创始人 Hayden Adams 本人转发。\\n\\n标的二：UNICASH—— 公开后第一个发行的代币\\n\\n合约：0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n真正意义上第一个被发的代币，目前市值只有30k，很低可以埋伏一点点。\\n\\n新东西我一定会玩的，亏我也只喜欢亏在新东西上。\\n\\n非投资建议DYOR", "url": "https://x.com/tiger_web3/status/2076740996990214175"}, {"id": "2083642070418211234", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "TakarahalM31385", "text": "@RobinhoodAlphas You can now trade $UNICASH with onchain limit orders on IrisApp. https://t.co/pOcmnjLkWq", "url": "https://x.com/TakarahalM31385/status/2083642070418211234"}, {"id": "2083633173510881742", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "RobinhoodAlphas", "text": "While most traders are focused on yesterday’s winners, new opportunities continue to emerge.\\n\\n$UNICASH is starting to gain attention on Robinhood Chain, and the chart is beginning to show signs of accumulation. \\nAs the first tradable token launched through Uniswap Auctions on Robinhood, it already holds a unique place in the ecosystem.\\n\\nIf momentum continues to build, this could be one to keep on your watchlist.\\n\\nCA:\\n0xfF0A037e3eCD3560B93E6b2163FEa48B81FEeFd1\\n\\nChart:\\nhttps://t.co/3tFbqdxkR1", "url": "https://x.com/RobinhoodAlphas/status/2083633173510881742"}, {"id": "2084368665424654816", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "0xPiracyData", "text": "@spe_ed3 Unicash!", "url": "https://x.com/0xPiracyData/status/2084368665424654816"}, {"id": "2076742145088815129", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "AKCB_Ron", "text": "@tiger_web3 上了一點 $UNICASH\\n第一個新機制發射的幣賠率太高 30k\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "url": "https://x.com/AKCB_Ron/status/2076742145088815129"}, {"id": "2077894600438743309", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "zaidancrypto", "text": "@CryptoMrLi888 $UNICASH\\n\\nCA\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "url": "https://x.com/zaidancrypto/status/2077894600438743309"}, {"id": "2076702844497911931", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "Przemyslaw35828", "text": "@Uniswap @RobinhoodCrypto Maybe some interact with $UNICASH and give some light to it\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "url": "https://x.com/Przemyslaw35828/status/2076702844497911931"}, {"id": "2083602336690118834", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "kranalicio", "text": "@Uniswap dot miss this summer $unicash\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "url": "https://x.com/kranalicio/status/2083602336690118834"}, {"id": "2083208112245186584", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "suskuntxt", "text": "Yes og unicash o v4 uniswap deployer", "url": "https://x.com/suskuntxt/status/2083208112245186584"}, {"id": "2076827094118482367", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "tiger_web3", "text": "Uni演示里面的代币是Unichain的，\\n而现在炒作的Unicorn是Robinhood，不是一个代币。目前被TST相关庄家控盘。\\n不过ED哥拿了每个项目底仓，吃麻了！\\n\\nUnicash是Robinhood第一个代币，这点是毋庸置疑的，目前100k也算低位了，之前30k发出来目前也有几倍了。\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1", "url": "https://x.com/tiger_web3/status/2076827094118482367"}, {"id": "2076835791234638232", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "hahaher6", "text": "0x6e820c8fc65a99ea5ccb3ad4c8d54d434fb69256\\n龙一$UNICORN 2M了，情绪很快溢出到$UniCash现金独角兽，这个比龙一出来还早，角度真的很好", "url": "https://x.com/hahaher6/status/2076835791234638232"}, {"id": "2084313179451003068", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "spe_ed3", "text": "Every project starts as a small conversation\\n\\nImagine telling someone you were around when the first Robinhood cca token launched.\\n\\n$UNICASH became the first token on Robinhood launched through cca and deployed through the Uniswap Token Factory. https://t.co/OtxQwpuGcg", "url": "https://x.com/spe_ed3/status/2084313179451003068"}, {"id": "2083635278363889907", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "theAdamcrypto", "text": "@UNICASH_RH All eyes on $UNICASH, keep building @UNICASH_RH", "url": "https://x.com/theAdamcrypto/status/2083635278363889907"}, {"id": "2083192754033549596", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "kranalicio", "text": "If you waiting launches from @Uniswap \\nIt'll be happeninh through autcion and it's been launhed 17days ago https://t.co/klfdIWUKuP\\n\\nThe first token which out from this platform its $UNICASH \\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1 https://t.co/eN4WQAYt6C", "url": "https://x.com/kranalicio/status/2083192754033549596"}, {"id": "2076774320937050494", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "DegenCamp", "text": "新东西肯定不能错过！\\n\\nUniswap 把「拍卖发币」搬上了 Robinhood 链，我把合约扒了一遍 - 龙头 TRASH 与首发 UNICASH 深度拆解\\n\\nRobinhood 这两天的火爆估计有目共睹，在热度刚准备退却之际，Uniswap官方下场做了拍卖模式的发射台，和Robinhood联名热度。\\n\\n省流CA：\\n目前龙一 $Trash：0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n台子第一个公开的币 $Unicash：\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n「CCA 拍卖，到底怎么运作」\\n\\nCCA 全称 Continuous Clearing Auction（连续清算拍卖）。和「先到先得的抢购」不同，它把出价放在连续多个区块里一起撮合、清算出一个公平价。整套流程是这样的：\\n\\n第 1 步｜网页一键发币（无代码） — 发起方在 Uniswap 网页填参数，由工厂合约 UERC20Factory 部署一个 10 亿供应的 ERC-20，不用写任何代码。\\n\\n第 2 步｜连续清算拍卖定价 — 买家出价，系统在多个区块内持续撮合，得出统一清算价，而不是第一个区块被机器人狙走。这从根上压低了狙击盘和捆绑盘。\\n\\n第 3 步｜建 Uniswap V4 池子 — 拍卖募到的 ETH + 代币，注入一个 Uniswap V4（1% 费率）的 TOKEN/ETH 池子。池子里的 ETH 大头是买家的钱，不是 dev 的。\\n\\n第 4 步｜流动性自动锁定 — 代表这个池子的 LP 仓位（一个 NFT）被转进 UniV4PositionLocker 锁仓合约，dev 从此不再持有它。\\n\\n第 5 步｜dev 靠手续费赚钱 — dev 手里没有代币预留盘，改为收取每笔交易的 1% 手续费（以代币形式），领取后卖成 ETH。这是它的收入模型。\\n\\n人话总结：发币不用写代码；定价靠「大家一起拍」而不是「谁手快」；池子建好后钥匙被锁进保险柜，dev 拿不回来；dev 不靠砸盘赚钱，靠抽你 1% 的过路费。\\n\\n会不会RUG？\\n合约层调查：四个关键地址（你可以自己核对）\\n\\n光听宣传没用。我把这套机制涉及的核心合约全挖了出来，都能在 Robinhood 链的 Blockscout 浏览器上逐个核对：\\n\\n发币工厂 UERC20Factory：0x000000e200088d55c39a11f609e5f667729ad49b\\n　所有 auction 代币由它部署，是机制入口。\\n\\nUniswap V4 池子管理器 PoolManager：0x8366a39cc670b4001a1121b8f6a443a643e40951\\n　所有池子的流动性实际存在这里（它常年是各币的「第一大持有者」，那其实是池子本身，不是巨鲸，别看错）。\\n\\nV4 仓位管理器 PositionManager (POSM)：0x58daec3116aae6d93017baaea7749052e8a04fa7\\n　每个池子的流动性用一个 NFT 表示，谁持有这个 NFT，谁就能撤流动性。\\n\\n流动性锁仓合约 UniV4PositionLocker：0x67551ce34ece44980c310838b391fb3ece7a7d15\\n　关键防 rug 部件。LP 仓位 NFT 被锁进这里，dev 交出控制权。\\n\\n保证了公平性，不会有池子RUG的情况，但是Dev会有源源不断的交易手续费，难免出现Dev会持续有一点点抛压。\\n\\n标的一：TRASH —— 跑出来的龙头\\n\\n合约：0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n发文时1.1M市值，把霉霉演唱会卖垃圾的叙事融合进来，加上Uniswap 创始人 Hayden Adams 本人转发。\\n\\n标的二：UNICASH—— 公开后第一个发行的代币\\n\\n合约：0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n真正意义上第一个被发的代币，目前市值只有30k，很低可以埋伏一点点。\\n\\n新东西我一定会玩的，亏我也只喜欢亏在新东西上。\\n\\n非投资建议DYOR", "url": "https://x.com/DegenCamp/status/2076774320937050494"}, {"id": "2076702351289937948", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "lemon_swiftie", "text": "$UNICASH\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\nWhy is this still priced here? Shouldn't it be worth at least a milli?\\n\\nThis is Uniswap's new tech, isn't it??", "url": "https://x.com/lemon_swiftie/status/2076702351289937948"}, {"id": "2082974279239618844", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "xsusacc", "text": "80k 4x\\n\\nmulti million please\\n\\nProf\\n\\n$UNICASH\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1 https://t.co/wSBNCIYex6", "url": "https://x.com/xsusacc/status/2082974279239618844"}, {"id": "2076458806339624961", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "hahaher6", "text": "0x6e820c8fc65a99ea5ccb3ad4c8d54d434fb69256\\n这个也不错，可以捡垃圾了，前排捆绑已经走完了，简直就是福布斯送来的罗宾汉专属MEME 哈哈。独角兽中间藏满了现金 $Unicash", "url": "https://x.com/hahaher6/status/2076458806339624961"}, {"id": "2076890611081531858", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "William88Crypto", "text": "@tiger_web3 那Unicash低位还能捡吗？", "url": "https://x.com/William88Crypto/status/2076890611081531858"}, {"id": "2083630828991680670", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "RobinhoodMemess", "text": "The biggest moves often begin before the market notices.\\n\\n$UNICASH is starting to gain traction on Robinhood Chain, and the chart is showing early signs of momentum. If this trend continues, it could emerge as one of the stronger performers from current levels.\\n\\nCA:\\n0xfF0A037e3eCD3560B93E6b2163FEa48B81FEeFd1\\n\\nChart:\\nhttps://t.co/DtSQ7Vb8Kh\\n\\nStill early, but definitely one worth keeping on the watchlist.\\n\\nDYOR. NFA.", "url": "https://x.com/RobinhoodMemess/status/2083630828991680670"}, {"id": "2082985474101047448", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "CryptoExpert101", "text": "first tradebly v4 token on Uniswap's Liquidity Launcher Robinhood\\nUNICASH: 0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\nUNICORN: 0x5f94e24a3293cf12c97d8b21c2f960adf471c951\\nTRASH: 0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\nABE: 0x38673a2ea3a527214422c9dc0c83ac3bbd83bc72\\n������: https://t.co/qPlGkSxgBD", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoExpert101/status/2082985474101047448"}, {"id": "2076702580202471658", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "CryptoExpert101", "text": "That was wild.\\n\\n40-50k &gt; 255k\\n\\n5x on $unicash \\n\\nSolid win", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoExpert101/status/2076702580202471658"}, {"id": "2076742734103363751", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "AKCB_Ron", "text": "龙一 $Trash\\n0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n1.3m\\n\\n台子第一个公开发射的