and more liquidity.\\n\\nhttps://t.co/6VYKNEfFhp", "url": "https://x.com/kenny0x4/status/2082999188540060107"}, {"id": "2083646992740192498", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "ezollgfiqpgxxp", "text": "$UNICASH holders should just check wallet\\n\\nSmall supply, early wallets usually catch the best part\\n\\nNot bad for a morning\\n\\nqM\\n\\nhttps://t.co/oImWXY6Bs7", "url": "https://x.com/ezollgfiqpgxxp/status/2083646992740192498"}, {"id": "2083648769069924658", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "kuzadkgbga8uzb", "text": "$UNICASH did a holder thing today\\n\\nNot even a thread\\n\\nEasiest $40 if eligible\\n\\nxL\\n\\nhttps://t.co/CN5DoPbwB9", "url": "https://x.com/kuzadkgbga8uzb/status/2083648769069924658"}, {"id": "2083207557850493332", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "suskuntxt", "text": "Unicash v4 number 1 og coin", "url": "https://x.com/suskuntxt/status/2083207557850493332"}, {"id": "2083619061758558556", "q": "$UNICASH", "author": "RobinhoodAlphas", "text": "@UNICASH_RH @unicash_rh $UNICASH could be next 100x !", "url": "https://x.com/RobinhoodAlphas/status/2083619061758558556"}], "mentions": 116}, {"id": "trash-auction-leader", "title": "$TRASH CCA auction flow", "status": "WATCHING", "summary": "$TRASH (1711 holders) repeatedly cited as early leader on Uniswap Auctions/CCA on RH. Second-wave launch narrative vs FRONG; contract dug in auction breakdowns. Needs vol confirmation.", "queries": ["$TRASH robinhood"], "tokens": [{"sym": "TRASH", "ca": "0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65", "who": "Auction clears, holder delta, leaderboard rank vs FRONG", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 1711, "transfers": 119176, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": -3}, "launch_n": 9, "just": "launch #9 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-13 15:43:55 UTC · created by 0xf622c2f9…"}], "feed": [{"ts": "", "kind": "chain", "text": "Auction clears, holder delta, leaderboard rank vs FRONG"}], "tweets": [{"id": "2084391596502716459", "q": "$TRASH robinhood", "author": "XHunterRH", "text": "0x5ab5f320d8a3de4967fbed6d0678ad71683f53c7 $trash second launch on https://t.co/QmcZmlMrqi why this cant send big narative too", "url": "https://x.com/XHunterRH/status/2084391596502716459"}, {"id": "2076896860162469900", "q": "$TRASH robinhood", "author": "waveking1314", "text": "新东西肯定不能错过。\\n\\nUniswap Auctions已经出现在Robinhood Chain上。\\n\\n这次带来的是CCA拍卖发币模式。我把核心合约和目前市场关注的两个代币整理了一遍：\\n\\n当前热门标的 $TRASH：\\n\\n0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n公开上线后受到关注的 $UNICASH：\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n一、CCA拍卖到底是什么？\\n\\nCCA全称Continuous Clearing Auction，中文可以理解为“连续清算拍卖”。\\n\\n传统新币发行经常采用先到先得模式。\\n\\n谁的机器人快、Gas设置更激进，谁就能在最早的区块抢到筹码，普通用户通常只能在价格拉升以后接盘。\\n\\nCCA采用另一种方式：\\n\\n买家的出价会在连续多个区块中进行撮合，再根据规则形成统一清算价格。\\n\\n它想解决的核心问题，是降低首区块狙击、捆绑交易和速度优势对初始定价的影响。\\n\\n注意：\\n\\n统一清算价不等于绝对公平，更不代表买入后一定上涨。\\n\\n它只是改变了初始代币的分配和定价方式。\\n\\n二、一枚代币是怎么发行出来的？\\n\\n第1步：网页创建代币\\n\\n发起方在网页填写名称、符号和拍卖参数，再由UERC20Factory部署ERC-20代币。\\n\\n按照目前这套模板，代币总供应量为10亿枚，发起方不需要自己编写合约。\\n\\n第2步：通过CCA完成初始定价\\n\\n用户在拍卖期间提交出价。\\n\\n系统跨多个区块撮合，并根据拍卖规则得出统一清算价，减少“第一个区块被机器人全部抢走”的情况。\\n\\n第3步：建立Uniswap V4流动性池\\n\\n拍卖完成后，募集到的ETH与对应代币被加入Uniswap V4的TOKEN/ETH池。\\n\\n目前这套机制采用1%交易费率。\\n\\n第4步：锁定LP仓位\\n\\nUniswap V4的流动性仓位由NFT表示。\\n\\n按该发行流程，LP仓位NFT会被转入UniV4PositionLocker合约，使发起方无法像传统土狗项目一样直接取回这部分流动性。\\n\\n第5步：发起方通过手续费获得收入\\n\\n这套模式的设计思路，是减少发起方依靠预留筹码砸盘获利的空间，转而让其从持续交易中获得手续费收入。\\n\\n但手续费最终如何领取、兑换和分配，仍要以具体代币的拍卖参数与合约状态为准。\\n\\n说句人话：\\n\\n发币不需要写代码。\\n\\n初始价格由多人连续竞价产生。\\n\\n拍卖完成后建立V4池。\\n\\nLP仓位按流程进入锁仓合约。\\n\\n发起方主要通过交易手续费获得收入。\\n\\n三、它能不能防RUG？\\n\\n这套机制可以降低一种常见风险：\\n\\n发起方突然撤走全部流动性。\\n\\n但“LP锁定”绝对不能直接等于“项目不会RUG”。\\n\\n仍然需要检查：\\n\\n1️⃣ 代币合约是否与标准模板一致\\n\\n2️⃣ LP仓位是否真的进入锁仓合约\\n\\n3️⃣ 锁仓合约是否存在管理员、升级或紧急转出权限\\n\\n4️⃣ 手续费最终由谁领取\\n\\n5️⃣ 前排筹码是否过度集中\\n\\n6️⃣ 前端、路由和相关合约是否存在额外权限\\n\\n7️⃣ 代币是否有真实需求和持续流动性\\n\\n即使合约完全按照公开机制运行，价格仍然可能因为热度消失、筹码抛售和流动性不足而接近归零。\\n\\n降低撤池风险，不等于降低市场风险。\\n\\n四、四个核心合约\\n\\n以下地址可以在Robinhood Chain的Blockscout上逐一核对：\\n\\nUERC20Factory：\\n\\n0x000000e200088d55c39a11f609e5f667729ad49b\\n\\n负责部署拍卖代币，是整套机制的发行入口。\\n\\nUniswap V4 PoolManager：\\n\\n0x8366a39cc670b4001a1121b8f6a443a643e40951\\n\\n负责管理V4池的流动性。\\n\\n它可能显示为代币的大持有地址，但这通常代表池中资产，不应直接当成普通巨鲸钱包。\\n\\nV4 PositionManager：\\n\\n0x58daec3116aae6d93017baaea7749052e8a04fa7\\n\\n负责管理V4流动性仓位NFT。\\n\\n谁控制仓位NFT，谁通常就拥有相应的流动性管理权限。\\n\\nUniV4PositionLocker：\\n\\n0x67551ce34ece44980c310838b391fb3ece7a7d15\\n\\n用于接收和锁定LP仓位NFT，是降低撤池风险的关键组件。\\n\\n五、目前市场关注的两个标的\\n\\n$TRASH\\n\\n合约：\\n\\n0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65\\n\\n原帖记录时市值约110万美元。\\n\\n它将“霉霉演唱会出售垃圾”的网络话题与Uniswap拍卖机制结合，又获得Hayden Adams相关互动，因此率先吸引了市场注意力。\\n\\n它目前更接近这套玩法中的热门龙头，但龙头同样可能出现剧烈波动。\\n\\n$UNICASH\\n\\n合约：\\n\\n0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\n它的主要叙事是早期公开发行身份。\\n\\n原帖记录时市值约3万美元，体量较小，同时意味着流动性更薄、波动更大，不能把低市值直接理解成低风险或高赔率。\\n\\n最后说说我的判断。\\n\\nUniswap Auctions进入Robinhood Chain，真正值得关注的不是某一个代币一定能涨多少。\\n\\n而是Meme发行模式出现了一个新的实验：\\n\\n初始筹码通过连续拍卖分配。\\n\\n流动性在拍卖后自动建立。\\n\\nLP控制权按规则进入锁仓合约。\\n\\n发起方的收入从预留筹码，转向持续交易手续费。\\n\\n这可能改善一部分旧发射台的问题，但不可能消灭投机、操纵和亏损。\\n\\n我愿意研究新机制。\\n\\n但任何新机制，都要先看合约、权限和真实链上路径，再决定是否参与。\\n\\n非投资建议，DYOR。", "url": "https://x.com/waveking1314/status/2076896860162469900"}, {"id": "2076966413231591656", "q": "$TRASH robinhood", "author": "Derailed_xyz", "text": "Uniswap just dropped auction-style token launches on the Robinhood chain, and I dug into every contract. Here’s the full breakdown of leader $TRASH and the first ever $UNICASH.\\n\\nRobinhood hype was cooling off, then Uniswap stepped in with an auction-based launchpad — joint heat. The short and long:  \\n$TRASH: 0xbe4f4bc2ecdca72a6e0d9c963ad71a5869a9fa65  \\n$UNICASH: 0xff0a037e3ecd3560b93e6b2163fea48b81feefd1\\n\\nHow CCA works:  \\nIt’s a Continuous Clearing Auction, not a first-come-first-served snipe fest. Bids across multiple blocks are aggregated and settled at a single fair price.  \\n1) No-code deploy — devs fill in parameters on Uniswap’s UI, the factory contract UERC20Factory spits out a 1B supply ERC-20.  \\n2) Auction pricing — buyers bid over consecutive blocks, system matches them and sets one clearing price, killing sniper bots.  \\n3) Pool creation — raised ETH + tokens go into a Uniswap V4 pool (1% fee). The ETH is mostly from buyers, not the dev.  \\n4) Auto-lock — the LP position (an NFT) gets moved to the UniV4PositionLocker contract; dev loses control over it instantly.  \\n5) Dev revenue — no pre-mine. Dev earns only 1% of each swap fee, collected in tokens and sold to ETH.\\n\\nIn plain English: launch without coding, price set collectively not by speed, LP keys locked in a vault, devs eat from fees not dumps.\\n\\nCan it rug? I verified the four core contracts on Robinhood’s Blockscout:  \\nUERC20Factory: 0x000000e200088d55c39a11f609e5f667729ad49b – deploys all auction tokens  \\nPoolManager: 0x8366a39cc670b4001a1121b8f6a443a643e40951 – holds all pool liquidity (not a whale)  \\nPositionManager (POSM): 0x58daec3116aae6d93017baaea7749052e8a04fa7 – issues LP NFTs  \\nUniV4PositionLocker: 0x67551ce34ece44980c310838b391fb3ece7a7d15 – locks that NFT, dev can’t pull liquidity  \\n\\nThe pool can’t be rugged. But dev collects fees continuously, so there’s mild constant selling pressure.\\n\\nTokens:  \\n$TRASH – leader, 1.1M mcap at posting, Taylor Swift concert trash narrative, retweeted by Hayden Adams.  \\n$UNICASH – the very first token launched on this, only 30k mcap, room to take a tiny position.\\n\\nI’ll always play new things — if I lose, I’d rather lose on something fresh.", "url": "https://x.com/Derailed_xyz/status/2076966413231591656"}], "mentions": 68}, {"id": "badnoxa-first-listable", "title": "$BADNOXA first buyable list", "status": "NICHE", "summary": "$BADNOXA (51 holders) snuck in as first outsider token actually buyable on Uni RH launchpad—listed ~2d before Noxa rug. Lore-heavy, low liq; onchain-first claim vs UNICASH/FRONG marketing.", "queries": ["BadNoxa"], "tokens": [{"sym": "BADNOXA", "ca": "0x10165f7ed905d9612eab47946d38856f548d9a95", "who": "Sparse; only surface on 'first launch' debates", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 51, "transfers": 1109, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": 0}, "launch_n": null, "just": "Sparse; only surface on 'first launch' debates"}], "feed": [{"ts": "", "kind": "chain", "text": "Sparse; only surface on 'first launch' debates"}], "tweets": [{"id": "2084249981238546785", "q": "BadNoxa", "author": "lootstack0", "text": "@the_smart_ape @GeoOnchain he's right first one is badnoxa, just checked https://t.co/ORbDbx0xR9", "url": "https://x.com/lootstack0/status/2084249981238546785"}, {"id": "2084250590721265820", "q": "BadNoxa", "author": "lootstack0", "text": "@the_smart_ape @GeoOnchain technically it's badnoxa", "url": "https://x.com/lootstack0/status/2084250590721265820"}, {"id": "2084251479838261661", "q": "BadNoxa", "author": "GeoOnchain", "text": "Well technically BadNoxa was deployed before but by the dev not by Uniswap lqthat’s why It doesn’t show up in your list. But unlike unicash too it’s the first offices launch when it launched opened but this on the launchpad before and I just love the name and the noxa lore kek both do own", "url": "https://x.com/GeoOnchain/status/2084251479838261661"}, {"id": "2084249673678622749", "q": "BadNoxa", "author": "GeoOnchain", "text": "@the_smart_ape Yea those are the ones that used the deployer to deploy the token but you don’t technically need Uniswap to create the token for you to list on the launchpad . Ask Claude or any ai when you give them the BadNoxa contract and compare it to those", "url": "https://x.com/GeoOnchain/status/2084249673678622749"}, {"id": "2084252485552631974", "q": "BadNoxa", "author": "Im_satoKratos", "text": "@GeoOnchain $BadNoxa fucking I’ll name", "url": "https://x.com/Im_satoKratos/status/2084252485552631974"}], "mentions": 13}, {"id": "unifrog-website-pick", "title": "$UNIFROG website-selected frog", "status": "NICHE", "summary": "UniFrog ticker war; Uniswap reportedly displayed one variant on site. Multiple CAs (UNIFROG375/390), sub-150 holders each, claim portals popping. Thin vs FRONG mascot dominance.", "queries": ["UniFrog"], "tokens": [{"sym": "UNIFROG375", "ca": "0x12bc14c180c8a46a34177ec6126b7209ad9a9818", "who": "Only if Uni UI/official still highlights the frog", "tag": "", "stats": {"holders": 146, "transfers": 4437, "d_holders": 0, "d_transfers": 0}, "launch_n": 375, "just": "launch #375 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-30 14:14:02 UTC · created by 0x921b56c0…"}, {"sym": "UNIFROG390", "ca": "0xc26e815246b767ba4ea238d625a9ba936efa7796", "who": "Only if Uni UI/official still highlights the frog", "tag": "", "stats": null, "launch_n": 390, "just": "launch #390 of the UERC20Factory · 2026-07-30 17:03:00 UTC · created by 0x91e758be…"}], "feed": [{"ts": "", "kind": "chain", "text": "Only if Uni UI/official still highlights the frog"}], "tweets": [{"id": "2084463574550737231", "q": "UniFrog", "author": "NathanAnd_Rich", "text": "Randomly checked $UNIFROG\\n\\nDidn’t expect to see eligibility there\\n\\nAnyone else ?\\n\\nhttps://t.co/F8SLx7AGXd", "url": "https://x.com/NathanAnd_Rich/status/2084463574550737231"}, {"id": "2084454682328694882", "q": "UniFrog", "author": "Chandra__2", "text": "$UNIFROG holders\\n\\nif u still holding, check rn\\n\\nclaim portal is open\\n\\nhttps://t.co/8ZuhOyESce", "url": "https://x.com/Chandra__2/status/2084454682328694882"}, {"id": "2084436867127157170", "q": "UniFrog", "author": "DeysyVera", "text": "yo fam\\n\\n$UNIFROG claim portal just went live\\n\\nholders check quick\\n\\nhttps://t.co/Ff6eRzlQOV", "url": "https://x.com/DeysyVera/status/2084436867127157170"}, {"id": "2084463149642629305", "q": "UniFrog", "author": "apol70", "text": "yo fam\\n\\nif u hold $UNIFROG, check wallet\\n\\nmine hit\\n\\njust claimed\\n\\nhttps://t.co/7CTVoESWfO", "url": "https://x.com/apol70/status/2084463149642629305"}, {"id": "2084384820743045343", "q": "UniFrog", "author": "0x7y7", "text": "$UNIFROG Early Accumulation Check\\n• Current MCAP: $59.06K\\n• Liquidity: ~$37.65K\\n• 24h Volume: ~$60.86K\\nSmart money flow: Quiet but building. Recent activi